{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T07:53:57.820Z","ordinal":377837,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17729-d173-7ea0-aeae-81952db7e099","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf0713abdc81a0a8b78788eadee9a1","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"That error confirms the cause: the **RC6** upgrader rejected GitHub’s signed download redirect while fetching RC7. The RC8 source contains the allowlist for that release-asset host, so this is an older-installer limitation. The signed URL’s temporary credentials have not been copied into the project records.\n\nTo install RC8 on **mike-dev**, the documented installer avoids RC6’s upgrade path and verifies the downloaded checksum:\n\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/main/install.sh | NEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.8 sh\n```\n\nI also made progress on the separate RC8 dogfooding failure: the missing verifier baseline can happen when the first workspace change comes from `run_command` or a subagent. The fix and regression cases are in an isolated worktree, and independent source review **accepted** them. Tests remain queued because Kimi currently holds the exclusive test-suite claim; I haven’t run tests concurrently or claimed the fix verified. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793001235698,"completed_at_ms":1793001237820}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T07:53:57.824Z","ordinal":377838,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf0713abdc81a0a8b78788eadee9a1","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"That error confirms the cause: the **RC6** upgrader rejected GitHub’s signed download redirect while fetching RC7. The RC8 source contains the allowlist for that release-asset host, so this is an older-installer limitation. The signed URL’s temporary credentials have not been copied into the project records.\n\nTo install RC8 on **mike-dev**, the documented installer avoids RC6’s upgrade path and verifies the downloaded checksum:\n\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/main/install.sh | NEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.8 sh\n```\n\nI also made progress on the separate RC8 dogfooding failure: the missing verifier baseline can happen when the first workspace change comes from `run_command` or a subagent. The fix and regression cases are in an isolated worktree, and independent source review **accepted** them. Tests remain queued because Kimi currently holds the exclusive test-suite claim; I haven’t run tests concurrently or claimed the fix verified. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17729-d173-7ea0-aeae-81952db7e099","create_time":1793001235.6733477,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf0713abdc81a0a8b78788eadee9a1","turn_id":"01a17729-d173-7ea0-aeae-81952db7e099","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a17733-ad40-7e43-bd5c-c8dfb5d7cf96","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":18565}}
