{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T07:55:35.078Z","ordinal":377899,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17734-064a-7c40-9dfa-d9e4ca640901","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-805f65d6-f159-4fb4-994a-d13a365d31d6","process_id":"66318","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh issue view 3 --json title,state,body,comments && cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md/owner.json 2>/dev/null || true && cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1_qualification_rc.7_terminal-matrix/owner.json 2>/dev/null || true && cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/REDACTED/owner.json 2>/dev/null || true"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 3 --json title,state,body,comments && cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_v1.0.0_TERMINAL-MATRIX-WORKSHEET.md/owner.json 2>/dev/null || true && cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1_qualification_rc.7_terminal-matrix/owner.json 2>/dev/null || true && cat /home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims/REDACTED/owner.json 2>/dev/null || true"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"body\":\"## Scope\\nComplete the manual E3 matrix on actual supported terminals; automated PTY tests are not a substitute for human interaction evidence.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n- Exercise the exact terminal × size matrix and required approval, typing/paste, cancellation, cleanup, resize, steering, and recovery cases from ACCEPTANCE.md §5.3.\\n- Record terminal/emulator, PTY, OS, launcher/build/package identity, scenario result, and required screenshots/evidence.\\n- Preserve failures and classify unavailable terminal environments as NOT RUN; do not silently substitute another terminal.\\n- Update REQ-QUAL-108 only when its manual evidence is complete.\\n\\nReference: `docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md` §5.3 and PLAN-10 task 12.\",\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfNboog\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Terminal environment preflight (setup only; no qualification cells run)\\n\\nThe connected Ubuntu 26.04 GNOME desktop is reachable and has an active local GNOME/Wayland session. All required terminal applications are installed: xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, and VS Code 1.143.1. The `nexus` command is not installed on that host yet.\\n\\nThe matrix remains 0/15. Each cell still requires the real interactive checks in ACCEPTANCE.md §5.3 and two screenshots (approval panel and post-exit terminal state). Current public RC4 is not the current source head: its commit is an ancestor of `main` and later source changes exist, so this setup check does not qualify RC4 or any later candidate. Install and run only the exact candidate selected for qualification.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T20:55:35Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6389426338\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfRhIFg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Terminal host preflight update (2026-10-25; setup only)\\n\\nThe Ubuntu 26.04 GNOME host has all five required terminal applications installed: xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, and VS Code 1.143.1. I also installed GitHub CLI 2.103.2 from GitHub CLI's official signed APT repository after verifying its published key fingerprint; `/usr/bin/gh attestation verify` is available for the candidate installer's provenance check.\\n\\nThis is environment setup only. No current-source RC is installed, no terminal cell has run, and the manual matrix remains 0/15. Each cell still needs the exact candidate identity, interactive checks, and both required screenshots.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T05:02:41Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6393710614\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfVycDQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### RC5 terminal matrix preparation (2026-10-25; no cells run)\\n\\nThe exact candidate is public as `v1.0.0-rc.5`, source commit `405f5b96e20b988523b99c8907d29b73bcd2a8fd`, with published archive SHA-256 `b15c45f6ac7684ce8752b45432df30d77b3ecd4cc7c4ab9ee1afc8670eea8c19`. The official installer and provenance were verified on the authenticated engineering host.\\n\\nThe connected Ubuntu 26.04/GNOME desktop has all five required terminals installed. The RC5 installer check there stopped before creating files because `gh auth status` reports no GitHub login; the version-scoped install prefix is absent. After signing in with GitHub CLI on that desktop, use the documented RC5 installer with prefix `$HOME/.local/rc5-qual-405f5`, verify `nexus --version` is `1.0.0-rc.5 (405f5b96e20b)`, and use that installed binary for the matrix.\\n\\nThe matrix remains **0/15**. Run `scripts/terminal-acceptance/run-cell.sh` once for each of the five terminals (`xterm`, `kitty`, `tmux-gnome`, `vscode`, `gnome`) at 80×24, 40×14, and 200×60. Each cell needs the interactive checks and two distinct screenshots (approval panel and post-exit terminal). Automated PTY checks do not count as these operator results. The existing script records installed binary identity, package manifest, per-check verdicts, screenshot hashes, mock request log, terminal restoration, and process-scope cleanup measurements.\\n\\nAcceptance is still in progress; no terminal cell is claimed complete by this setup update.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:23:04Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6398188557\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfV6-OQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### RC5 installer verification follow-up (2026-10-25; no cells run)\\n\\nOn the connected Ubuntu 26.04/GNOME desktop, the public RC5 archive downloads successfully and its SHA-256 matches the published `SHA256SUMS` entry (`b15c45f6ac7684ce8752b45432df30d77b3ecd4cc7c4ab9ee1afc8670eea8c19`). The installer’s required provenance verification remains unavailable because GitHub CLI is not signed in on that host (`gh attestation verify` requests `gh auth login`). I did not set `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=0` or create an installation. The version-scoped prefix remains absent; the terminal matrix is still 0/15.\\n\\nTo proceed with the official installer and preserve the provenance gate, sign in on that desktop using GitHub CLI, then rerun the documented installer command from the prior update.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:36:53Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6398328377\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfV9ipg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Candidate selection correction (2026-10-25)\\n\\nRC5 has now failed its official cross-runner comparison because the published SBOM and rebuild SBOMs record different npm versions. Do not treat terminal runs on RC5 as v1.0.0 acceptance evidence. Keep the matrix at **0/15** and retain the existing worksheet/setup notes; after the toolchain fix is integrated and the successor RC is built and published, install that exact successor with provenance verification and bind every cell and screenshot to its identity and digest.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:40:58Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6398370470\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 12: complete the real-terminal acceptance matrix\"}\n{\n  \"agent\": \"/root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/terminal-matrix-rc4-worksheet\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-rc3\",\n  \"base\": \"016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-23T09:20:00Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Prepare the REQ-QUAL-108 operator worksheet for the next eligible RC; no matrix results or acceptance claim\",\n  \"reviewer\": \"current_main_rc_path_audit\",\n  \"review_disposition\": \"ACCEPT\",\n  \"reviewed_at\": \"2026-10-25T05:47:00Z\",\n  \"status\": \"RC7 is now present on ubuntu-desktop at /home/mike/.local/lib/nexus/v1.0.0-rc.7; CLI reports 1.0.0-rc.7 (431cb194931f), installed package tree matches published archive byte-for-byte excluding installer-created .provenance.json, and provenance archive SHA256 matches public digest 367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a. Host runs Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS with xterm, kitty, GNOME Terminal, tmux 3.6, VS Code; active GNOME Wayland seat. Matrix remains 0/15; no screenshots/manual behavior claimed. Existing worksheet branch remains unintegrated; no evidence changes made.\",\n  \"head\": \"2b55c031498412747f5e2ef09b4ef9e288ac77ca\",\n  \"desktop_rc4_archive_sha256\": \"07867e26077e5eec6f2cb665c4c34045a116669cacbe7f81f62f40b6fac8b806\",\n  \"desktop_rc4_cli_version\": \"1.0.0-rc.4 (57b9285c6cea)\",\n  \"terminal_matrix_completed_cells\": 0,\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T01:48:00Z\"\n}\n{\"agent\":\"codex-root\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"branch\":\"v1/plan-01-sec101-119-pty-followup\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/sec101-119-pty-followup\",\"base\":\"19b30a4c92b8dd2c891c5b7a5b67db319ee9ee7f\",\"since\":\"2026-10-25T01:54:00Z\",\"scope\":\"Record exact current-base revalidation of SEC-101/119 focused PTY tests and requirement gate; no product or release changes.\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":482427499}},"started_at_ms":1793001334595,"completed_at_ms":1793001335078}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T07:55:37.132Z","ordinal":377900,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17735-312c-71f2-a848-1f974b0a0e8a","call_id":"call_728a810a2d1642a4852f40ae030448f3","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"body\":\"## Scope\\nComplete the manual E3 matrix on actual supported terminals; automated PTY tests are not a substitute for human interaction evidence.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n- Exercise the exact terminal × size matrix and required approval, typing/paste, cancellation, cleanup, resize, steering, and recovery cases from ACCEPTANCE.md §5.3.\\n- Record terminal/emulator, PTY, OS, launcher/build/package identity, scenario result, and required screenshots/evidence.\\n- Preserve failures and classify unavailable terminal environments as NOT RUN; do not silently substitute another terminal.\\n- Update REQ-QUAL-108 only when its manual evidence is complete.\\n\\nReference: `docs/v1.0.0/ACCEPTANCE.md` §5.3 and PLAN-10 task 12.\",\"comments\":[{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfNboog\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Terminal environment preflight (setup only; no qualification cells run)\\n\\nThe connected Ubuntu 26.04 GNOME desktop is reachable and has an active local GNOME/Wayland session. All required terminal applications are installed: xterm XTerm(407), kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, and VS Code 1.143.1. The `nexus` command is not installed on that host yet.\\n\\nThe matrix remains 0/15. Each cell still requires the real interactive checks in ACCEPTANCE.md §5.3 and two screenshots (approval panel and post-exit terminal state). Current public RC4 is not the current source head: its commit is an ancestor of `main` and later source changes exist, so this setup check does not qualify RC4 or any later candidate. Install and run only the exact candidate selected for qualification.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T20:55:35Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6389426338\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfRhIFg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Terminal host preflight update (2026-10-25; setup only)\\n\\nThe Ubuntu 26.04 GNOME host has all five required terminal applications installed: xterm 407, kitty 0.45.0, GNOME Terminal 3.58.0, tmux 3.6, and VS Code 1.143.1. I also installed GitHub CLI 2.103.2 from GitHub CLI's official signed APT repository after verifying its published key fingerprint; `/usr/bin/gh attestation verify` is available for the candidate installer's provenance check.\\n\\nThis is environment setup only. No current-source RC is installed, no terminal cell has run, and the manual matrix remains 0/15. Each cell still needs the exact candidate identity, interactive checks, and both required screenshots.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T05:02:41Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6393710614\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfVycDQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### RC5 terminal matrix preparation (2026-10-25; no cells run)\\n\\nThe exact candidate is public as `v1.0.0-rc.5`, source commit `405f5b96e20b988523b99c8907d29b73bcd2a8fd`, with published archive SHA-256 `b15c45f6ac7684ce8752b45432df30d77b3ecd4cc7c4ab9ee1afc8670eea8c19`. The official installer and provenance were verified on the authenticated engineering host.\\n\\nThe connected Ubuntu 26.04/GNOME desktop has all five required terminals installed. The RC5 installer check there stopped before creating files because `gh auth status` reports no GitHub login; the version-scoped install prefix is absent. After signing in with GitHub CLI on that desktop, use the documented RC5 installer with prefix `$HOME/.local/rc5-qual-405f5`, verify `nexus --version` is `1.0.0-rc.5 (405f5b96e20b)`, and use that installed binary for the matrix.\\n\\nThe matrix remains **0/15**. Run `scripts/terminal-acceptance/run-cell.sh` once for each of the five terminals (`xterm`, `kitty`, `tmux-gnome`, `vscode`, `gnome`) at 80×24, 40×14, and 200×60. Each cell needs the interactive checks and two distinct screenshots (approval panel and post-exit terminal). Automated PTY checks do not count as these operator results. The existing script records installed binary identity, package manifest, per-check verdicts, screenshot hashes, mock request log, terminal restoration, and process-scope cleanup measurements.\\n\\nAcceptance is still in progress; no terminal cell is claimed complete by this setup update.\\n\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:23:04Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6398188557\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfV6-OQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### RC5 installer verification follow-up (2026-10-25; no cells run)\\n\\nOn the connected Ubuntu 26.04/GNOME desktop, the public RC5 archive downloads successfully and its SHA-256 matches the published `SHA256SUMS` entry (`b15c45f6ac7684ce8752b45432df30d77b3ecd4cc7c4ab9ee1afc8670eea8c19`). The installer’s required provenance verification remains unavailable because GitHub CLI is not signed in on that host (`gh attestation verify` requests `gh auth login`). I did not set `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=0` or create an installation. The version-scoped prefix remains absent; the terminal matrix is still 0/15.\\n\\nTo proceed with the official installer and preserve the provenance gate, sign in on that desktop using GitHub CLI, then rerun the documented installer command from the prior update.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:36:53Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6398328377\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true},{\"id\":\"IC_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABfV9ipg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Candidate selection correction (2026-10-25)\\n\\nRC5 has now failed its official cross-runner comparison because the published SBOM and rebuild SBOMs record different npm versions. Do not treat terminal runs on RC5 as v1.0.0 acceptance evidence. Keep the matrix at **0/15** and retain the existing worksheet/setup notes; after the toolchain fix is integrated and the successor RC is built and published, install that exact successor with provenance verification and bind every cell and screenshot to its identity and digest.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T13:40:58Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"isMinimized\":false,\"minimizedReason\":\"\",\"reactionGroups\":[],\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6398370470\",\"viewerDidAuthor\":true}],\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 12: complete the real-terminal acceptance matrix\"}\n{\n  \"agent\": \"/root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/terminal-matrix-rc4-worksheet\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/terminal-matrix-rc3\",\n  \"base\": \"016bbc332d694b32072f6346e7f3127fb98b691f\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-23T09:20:00Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Prepare the REQ-QUAL-108 operator worksheet for the next eligible RC; no matrix results or acceptance claim\",\n  \"reviewer\": \"current_main_rc_path_audit\",\n  \"review_disposition\": \"ACCEPT\",\n  \"reviewed_at\": \"2026-10-25T05:47:00Z\",\n  \"status\": \"RC7 is now present on ubuntu-desktop at /home/mike/.local/lib/nexus/v1.0.0-rc.7; CLI reports 1.0.0-rc.7 (431cb194931f), installed package tree matches published archive byte-for-byte excluding installer-created .provenance.json, and provenance archive SHA256 matches public digest 367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a. Host runs Ubuntu 26.04.1 LTS with xterm, kitty, GNOME Terminal, tmux 3.6, VS Code; active GNOME Wayland seat. Matrix remains 0/15; no screenshots/manual behavior claimed. Existing worksheet branch remains unintegrated; no evidence changes made.\",\n  \"head\": \"2b55c031498412747f5e2ef09b4ef9e288ac77ca\",\n  \"desktop_rc4_archive_sha256\": \"07867e26077e5eec6f2cb665c4c34045a116669cacbe7f81f62f40b6fac8b806\",\n  \"desktop_rc4_cli_version\": \"1.0.0-rc.4 (57b9285c6cea)\",\n  \"terminal_matrix_completed_cells\": 0,\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T01:48:00Z\"\n}\n{\"agent\":\"codex-root\",\"host\":\"mike-dev\",\"branch\":\"v1/plan-01-sec101-119-pty-followup\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/sec101-119-pty-followup\",\"base\":\"19b30a4c92b8dd2c891c5b7a5b67db319ee9ee7f\",\"since\":\"2026-10-25T01:54:00Z\",\"scope\":\"Record exact current-base revalidation of SEC-101/119 focused PTY tests and requirement gate; no product or release changes.\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17734-064a-7c40-9dfa-d9e4ca640901","create_time":1793001337.1322274}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
