Pushed to Origin\n22342 9:49p ✓ RC7 Version Bump Branch Pushed to Origin — Fresh Push, Not a Re-push\n22281 \" ○ RC7 Final Source Gate Passes — Clean Worktree at HEAD 7eeb386, Branch Pushed to origin\n22344 \" ○ Agent Pool Status — Three Subagents Completed: PR #232 ACCEPT, Heldout Audit, PR #240 ACCEPT\n22286 \" ○ PR #241 CI Started — CodeQL and CI Runs Triggered on 7eeb386\n22348 \" ○ PR #241 CI Started — Three Checks In Progress at 7eeb386\n22288 \" ○ PR #241 Status — BLOCKED Pending CI; CodeRabbit Skipped, 3 Checks Pending\n22351 \" ○ RC6 repl.ts Checkpoint Behavior — Only 5-Choice Sensitive Dialog, No Generic Failure Handling\n22356 \" ○ RC7 Upgrade \"Disallowed Download Origin\" Error — Full Redirect URL Confirmed\n22358 \" ○ REPL Checkpoint File Claims Still Active — codex-root Holds Both Test Files\n22359 9:50p ○ PR #240 Merged — REPL Checkpoint File Claims Are Stale and Should Be Released\n22360 \" ○ PR #241 CI Still Running — Three Checks In Progress, Merge Blocked\n22362 \" ✓ Stale REPL Checkpoint Claim Released and New Slice Claimed for Initial Failure Test\n22364 9:51p ◆ New REPL Checkpoint Regression Test Added — Initial Protected Git Verification Failure\n22309 \" ○ PR #241 CodeQL Run Completed Suc…172 tokens truncated…ered for Head 99217b0 — Fresh CodeQL and Test Matrix Queued\n22315 9:52p ○ RC7 PR #241 Independent Review ACCEPT — rc5_candidate_review Agent Approved Exact Diff\n22316 \" ○ PR #241 CI Step-Level Progress — CodeQL Analysis Complete, Test Matrix at cargo test Step\n22317 9:53p ○ PR #241 CodeQL Check Completed Successfully — Test Matrix Still Running\n22318 \" ○ PLAN-10 Issue #1 Custody Requests Remain Unanswered — Three Follow-Up Comments Posted\n22332 10:06p ○ PR #241 test-matrix Node 24 Job Completed Successfully\n22333 10:09p ○ PR #241 Both Test-Matrix Jobs Passed — Linux x86_64 Packaging Job Now Running\nS1731 RC7 candidate PR #241 — source verification, independent review, and CI monitoring through linux-x86_64 packaging job (Oct 25