her imports their Markdown notes into claude-mem. Never assume a hosted memory search was intercepted: search claude-mem directly when its result is needed.\n\nFull hook output saved to: /tmp/hook_outputs/01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92/2aa54e0f-7868-4cb3-a52c-ac1e292abb30.txt"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17734-064a-7c40-9dfa-d9e4ca640901","create_time":1793001767.1320448,"content_item_kinds":["hooks.additional_context"]}}}
