{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:03:15.857Z","ordinal":378279,"type":"response_item","payload":{"id":"rs_060b64278a9dfb15016adf093ed4e481a0bbded83ea9ec1eef","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17734-064a-7c40-9dfa-d9e4ca640901"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:03:17.377Z","ordinal":378280,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17734-064a-7c40-9dfa-d9e4ca640901","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf0943d5d081a0baf1ce59b5a17f63","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"That confirms the cause: **RC6 rejected GitHub’s redirect to its signed release-asset host**, so the upgrade stopped after making the backup. The URL also contained a temporary signature; I won’t repeat it.\n\nThe fix is in **RC8**: it allows that specific GitHub release-asset path and reports only the URL’s origin in errors, avoiding disclosure of signed query parameters. I verified the change in the RC7 and RC8 source tags.\n\nThe earlier RC8 install was isolated for qualification, so it did **not** replace the regular RC6 installation on mike-dev. To get past this failure, install RC8 through its verified release installer; trying RC7 again from RC6 will hit the same redirect rejection."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793001795860,"completed_at_ms":1793001797377}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:03:17.381Z","ordinal":378281,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf0943d5d081a0baf1ce59b5a17f63","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"That confirms the cause: **RC6 rejected GitHub’s redirect to its signed release-asset host**, so the upgrade stopped after making the backup. The URL also contained a temporary signature; I won’t repeat it.\n\nThe fix is in **RC8**: it allows that specific GitHub release-asset path and reports only the URL’s origin in errors, avoiding disclosure of signed query parameters. I verified the change in the RC7 and RC8 source tags.\n\nThe earlier RC8 install was isolated for qualification, so it did **not** replace the regular RC6 installation on mike-dev. To get past this failure, install RC8 through its verified release installer; trying RC7 again from RC6 will hit the same redirect rejection.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17734-064a-7c40-9dfa-d9e4ca640901","create_time":1793001795.8371987,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf0943d5d081a0baf1ce59b5a17f63","turn_id":"01a17734-064a-7c40-9dfa-d9e4ca640901","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a1773c-3705-7e70-8f33-a41b04d2e37a","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":18575}}
