{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:04:19.725Z","ordinal":378326,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adf09833f3481a0a2714dfadcc8faf7","status":"completed","call_id":"call_a74f9a50390b492b8966f9b8e60fbe8e","name":"exec","input":"const xs=ALL_TOOLS.filter(x=>x.name.startsWith(\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__\") && /register_agent|list_agents|send_message|fetch_inbox/.test(x.name));\ntext(xs.map(x=>x.name+\"\\n\"+x.description.slice(0,700)).join(\"\\n---\\n\"));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1773c-9417-7e32-a0cb-d3e5e6bfeafe","create_time":1793001859.2483957}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:04:19.768Z","ordinal":378327,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1773c-9417-7e32-a0cb-d3e5e6bfeafe","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a1773c-9417-7e32-a0cb-d3e5e6bfeafe","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016adf097adf2081a0a7d9031991076633","usage":{"input_tokens":97486,"cached_input_tokens":87296,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":811,"reasoning_output_tokens":732,"total_tokens":98297},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":427011,"cached_input_tokens":406144,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2427,"reasoning_output_tokens":1588,"total_tokens":429438},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":6922127192,"cached_input_tokens":6848025472,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":19861808,"reasoning_output_tokens":11514985,"total_tokens":6941989000}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:04:19.773Z","ordinal":378328,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1773d-2abd-73e1-87db-d36b2a5a6c16","call_id":"call_a74f9a50390b492b8966f9b8e60fbe8e","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRemove an agent from a project. Marks the agent as inactive and removes it from the active roster. Messages from/to the agent are preserved for audit but the agent can no longer send or receive new messages.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```ts\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent(args: { agent_name: string; project_key: string; registration_token?: string | null; }): Promise<CallToolResult<{ [key: string]:\n---\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nRetrieve recent messages for an agent without mutating read/ack state.\n\nFilters\n-------\n- `urgent_only`: only messages with importance in {high, urgent}\n- `since_ts`: ISO-8601 timestamp string; messages strictly newer than this are returned\n- `limit`: max number of messages (default 20)\n- `include_bodies`: include full Markdown bodies in the payloads\n- `topic`: filter to messages with this topic tag\n\nUsage patterns\n--------\n---\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__register_agent\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nCreate or update an agent identity within a project and persist its profile to Git.\n\nWhen to use\n-----------\n- At the start of a coding session by any automated agent.\n- To update an existing agent's program/model/task metadata and bump last_active.\n\nSemantics\n---------\n- If `name` is omitted, a random adjective+noun name is auto-generated.\n- Reusing the same `name` updates the profile (program/model/task) and\n  refreshes `\n---\nmcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message\nYou are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\n\nSend a Markdown message to one or more recipients and persist canonical and mailbox copies to Git.\n\nDiscovery\n---------\nTo discover available agent names for recipients, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\nAgent names are NOT the same as program names or user names.\n\nWhat this does\n--------------\n- Stores message (and recipients) in the database; updates sender's activity\n- Writes a canonical `.md` under `messages/YYYY/MM/"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1773c-9417-7e32-a0cb-d3e5e6bfeafe","create_time":1793001859.773077}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
