{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:05:45.042Z","ordinal":378417,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adf09d2abe081a0a02e9f19d40e26c2","status":"completed","call_id":"call_66816eaea5804d8d8cd85cce02dda926","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc7-checkpoint/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md\\n@@\\n # v1.0.0 release readiness checkpoint\\n+\\n+## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 08:05 UTC)\\n+\\n+**Authoritative source and source gates:** `origin/main` is `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`. Exact-main CI run [40279197785](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197785) completed successfully on this commit; all three required jobs (`test-matrix (22)`, `test-matrix (24)`, and `linux-x86_64`) passed. CodeQL run [40279197561](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40279197561) passed. The requirements enforcement and version synchronization checks passed on the same source: 123 requirements (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open; 12 remain explicitly deferred to exact-RC qualification), with package components at `1.0.0-rc.8`.\\n+\\n+**RC8 construction and reproducibility:** Public prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) was published at 07:26 UTC and resolves to the exact source commit above. Its Linux archive has GitHub asset digest `sha256:bbded963a9bcaa9c0764b86d900f752c46ed364bfe30cc67e5bbf23b5fb5f48e`. Cross-runner RC reproducibility workflow [40286712425](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40286712425) completed successfully against that exact tag, including Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 builds and artifact comparison. An installed RC8 copy was also provenance-verified on the Ubuntu desktop in an isolated qualification prefix; this was not the user's normal Nexus installation and is not full installed-RC acceptance. The earlier RC6-to-RC7 upgrade attempt failed because RC6 rejected GitHub's signed release-asset redirect. The redirect allowlist and URL-secret redaction are present in RC8; the RC6 installation was not changed by the isolated RC8 check.\\n+\\n+**Acceptance blockers:** Issue [#1](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1) remains OPEN; the custodian has not responded to the metadata-only request, and private custody acceptance, evaluator compatibility and sealing are not established. Held-out qualification has not started. Exact-RC provider/standalone qualification, T2/T3 and nine-class T4 qualification, and independent RC acceptance remain incomplete. The human terminal matrix remains 0/15; automated PTY checks do not satisfy it. Stable `v1.0.0` is not published. Campaign status remains `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`; publication authorization remains granted but gated on acceptance.\\n+\\n+The 06:24 checkpoint immediately below is retained as a historical snapshot; this update supersedes its CI conclusion, RC publication state, cross-runner status, and current blocker summary.\\n \\n ## Current release checkpoint (observed 2026-10-26 06:24 UTC at `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`)\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1773c-9417-7e32-a0cb-d3e5e6bfeafe","create_time":1793001938.6904588}}}
