{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:17:41.051Z","ordinal":379030,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17747-5c00-79e0-9591-d386e30fc22a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf0ca3657c81a0bdc8bf4fc82c597d","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The upgrade error is explained: RC6’s updater rejects GitHub’s newer signed `release-assets.githubusercontent.com` redirect host. The fix was already merged in PR #248 and is included in the RC8 source, but an old updater can’t use that fix to download its first patched release. I’m checking the RC8 installer’s verified recovery path while CI and the owned suite finish."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793002659430,"completed_at_ms":1793002661050}}
