{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:21:17.839Z","ordinal":379115,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17747-5c00-79e0-9591-d386e30fc22a","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-b9e0f48f-6ea0-4018-bead-74a66224a26c","process_id":"10209","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n '248|signed release|upgrade' /home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc7-checkpoint/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | tail -25; gh pr view 248 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json mergeCommit,mergedAt"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"rg -n '248|signed release|upgrade' /home/mike/nexus-wt/readiness-rc7-checkpoint/docs/v1.0.0/READINESS.md | tail -25; gh pr view 248 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json mergeCommit,mergedAt"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"7:**RC8 construction and reproducibility:** Public prerelease [v1.0.0-rc.8](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc.8) was published at 07:26 UTC and resolves to the exact source commit above. Its Linux archive has GitHub asset digest `sha256:bbded963a9bcaa9c0764b86d900f752c46ed364bfe30cc67e5bbf23b5fb5f48e`. Cross-runner RC reproducibility workflow [40286712425](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40286712425) completed successfully against that exact tag, including Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 builds and artifact comparison. An installed RC8 copy was also provenance-verified on the Ubuntu desktop in an isolated qualification prefix ([setup record](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/3#issuecomment-6411066559)); this was not the user's normal Nexus installation and is not full installed-RC acceptance. The tag's local GPG signature verifies, but GitHub reports it as unverified (`bad_email`); the stable tag must use a signer identity that GitHub verifies against the signing key. The earlier RC6-to-RC7 upgrade attempt failed because RC6 rejected GitHub's signed release-asset redirect. The redirect allowlist and URL-secret redaction are present in RC8; the RC6 installation was not changed by the isolated RC8 check.\n40:**RC and qualification:** GitHub prerelease `v1.0.0-rc.7` resolves to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`, before PR #243 and later main changes; its Linux archive SHA-256 is `367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a`. The tag object contains a PGP signature, but GitHub reports the signature as unverified (`bad_email`); it is not verified-signature provenance. RC7 cross-runner reproducibility passed (run [40248074777](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248074777)) and installed ChatGPT verification passed 3/3 with `gpt-6-luna`; both results apply only to RC7. The five-environment by three-size human terminal matrix remains 0/15. T2/T3/T4 and standalone/provider qualification remain incomplete; no held-out execution has started.\n54:**RC and qualification:** GitHub prerelease `v1.0.0-rc.7` resolves to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`, before PR #243 and later main changes; its Linux archive SHA-256 is `367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a`. The tag object contains a PGP signature, but GitHub reports the signature as unverified (`bad_email`); it is not verified-signature provenance. RC7 cross-runner reproducibility passed (run [40248074777](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248074777)) and installed ChatGPT verification passed 3/3 with `gpt-6-luna`; both results apply only to RC7. The five-environment by three-size human terminal matrix remains 0/15. T2/T3/T4 and standalone/provider qualification remain incomplete; no held-out execution has started.\n68:**RC and qualification:** Signed prerelease `v1.0.0-rc.7` still resolves to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`, before PR #243 and later main changes; its Linux archive digest is `367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a`. RC7 cross-runner reproducibility passed (run [40248074777](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248074777)) and installed ChatGPT verification passed 3/3 with `gpt-6-luna`; those results apply only to RC7. The five-environment by three-size human terminal matrix remains 0/15. T2/T3/T4 and standalone/provider qualification remain incomplete; no held-out execution has started.\n80:**RC7 qualification evidence:** Signed prerelease `v1.0.0-rc.7` remains the latest published candidate, resolving to source `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`; its Linux archive digest remains `367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a`. Cross-runner reproducibility passed for RC7 only (run [40248074777](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248074777)); ChatGPT provider verification passed 3/3 on the installed RC7 using `gpt-6-luna`. A fresh provider-status check on the Ubuntu desktop at 01:54 UTC found ChatGPT connected and OpenRouter disconnected. RC7 evidence does not qualify a later candidate or establish acceptance.\n88:**Exact `main` source gates:** `origin/main` is `0542312a0364b03cec5b66b6cb8234b210805cd2`, merging PR #243's checkpoint index-lock diagnostic fix. Exact-main CI [40248550055](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248550055) and CodeQL [40248550144](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248550144) both passed on that SHA. A clean detached checkout with isolated HOME/XDG passed `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: 123 rows (108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open), with 12 explicit exact-RC deferrals. The PR #243 diff SHA-256 `fb6b7d5d81d66cb237799b4d7a41c3dfd59f931eeaa84e75117a38bf9fc97928` matched its independently accepted diff exactly. RC7 predates this merge and cannot qualify the updated source.\n90:**RC7 artifact evidence:** The tag's release workflow produced the public assets and attestations. `gh attestation verify` passed for both the archive and `SHA256SUMS` under the exact repository, workflow, tag, and source constraints; the checksum-index attestation is [59728626](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/attestations/59728626). Cross-runner workflow [40248074777](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248074777) passed on Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04. Both manifests validated, and the archive, checksum manifest, notices, compatibility file, installer, and CycloneDX SBOM matched byte-for-byte across the two runner outputs and the public release. An isolated install reports `1.0.0-rc.7 (431cb194931f)`. These are artifact and installation checks, not product qualification.\n154:**Node runtime floor:** The accepted user decision is Node `>=22`. PR #150 integrates that floor in package engines, installer checks, CLI diagnostics and upgrade behavior, CI/release/reproducibility configuration, tests, and current release documentation. Superseded PRs #137 and #146 were closed after their intended policy changes were verified in current main; their older branch evidence is not current qualification evidence.\n168:**Node runtime floor:** The accepted user decision is Node `>=22`. PR #150 integrates that floor in package engines, installer checks, CLI diagnostics and upgrade behavior, CI/release/reproducibility configuration, tests, and current release documentation. Superseded PRs #137 and #146 were closed after their intended policy changes were verified in current main; their older branch evidence is not current qualification evidence.\n418:- E2 is **partial**: all eight fresh-install/minimum-runtime cells and eight expected negative preflight cells passed across the prepared Ubuntu 22.04/24.04, Debian 12 and Fedora 40 images. One Ubuntu 22.04 / Node 22 lifecycle cell passed alpha.2 upgrade, repair, rollback and uninstall. The remaining lifecycle cases are not complete. Current-source evaluator host preflight passed 10/10 using synthetic markers only; this is not held-out custody or qualification evidence.\n{\"mergeCommit\":{\"oid\":\"a7880b64c98d5f3f6522a18a97b2a10489f9461e\"},\"mergedAt\":\"2026-10-26T04:59:56Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":389136580}},"started_at_ms":1793002877449,"completed_at_ms":1793002877839}}
