{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T08:39:01.656Z","ordinal":379681,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17747-5c00-79e0-9591-d386e30fc22a","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf11a0441481a0a1c68a2e04a5ae81","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The upgrade failure was a compatibility bug in the older updater: GitHub redirected the download to its signed release-assets host, which RC6 rejected. PR #248 fixed the allowlist and stopped error messages from exposing signed URLs. The fix is in RC8.\n\nA read-only check now finds **RC7** active on mike-dev, with RC6 still installed. The RC7 package manifest verifies. The symlink changed at 06:30 UTC, but I can’t tell from filesystem metadata which process switched it. RC7 has the same old updater, so use the RC8 release installer for the next upgrade.\n\nOn **mike-dev**, with GitHub CLI authenticated there, this verifies the installer script’s release digest and requires provenance verification of the package:\n\n```sh\ntmpdir=\"$(mktemp -d)\"\ngh release download v1.0.0-rc.8 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --pattern install.sh --dir \"$tmpdir\"\nprintf '%s  %s\\n' '5620d56ef6f8d637fc102ae2c8ea3b055effbc4069243a2df68b67520b1e2302' \"$tmpdir/install.sh\" | sha256sum --check\nNEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.8 NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1 sh \"$tmpdir/install.sh\"\n```\n\nI have **not** changed the mike-dev installation.\n\nFor the release campaign, main is still `bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`; RC8 is published as a prerelease, and no stable v1.0.0 release exists. PR #251’s Node 22 and 24 jobs passed; Linux packaging is still running its CLI tests. I have a reviewed follow-up commit ready locally and will push it after that workflow finishes. Held-out qualification remains blocked on the custodian’s unanswered status request; the real terminal matrix is still 0/15.\n\nThe Ubuntu host has the RC8 terminal harness prepared. To run each of the 15 real terminal/size combinations, set `PATH` to `$HOME/.local/rc8-qual-bbafae/bin`, go to `$HOME/.local/share/nexus-qualification/v1.0.0-rc.8/terminal-acceptance`, then run `./run-cell.sh` for each terminal (`xterm`, `kitty`, `tmux-gnome`, `vscode`, `gnome`) at `80x24`, `40x14`, and `200x60`. The harness asks for human judgments and two screenshots per cell. It will capture evidence but does not count automated PTY runs as the manual gate.\n\n**Disposition: `NEXUS_V1_RC_QUALIFICATION_ACTIVE`; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`.**"}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793003936291,"completed_at_ms":1793003941656}}
