e/bin`, go to `$HOME/.local/share/nexus-qualification/v1.0.0-rc.8/terminal-acceptance`, then run `./run-cell.sh` for each terminal (`xterm`, `kitty`, `tmux-gnome`, `vscode`, `gnome`) at `80x24`, `40x14`, and `200x60`. The harness asks for human judgments and two screenshots per cell. It will capture evidence but does not count automated PTY runs as the manual gate.\n\n**Disposition: `NEXUS_V1_RC_QUALIFICATION_ACTIVE`; acceptance remains `IN_PROGRESS`.**","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17747-5c00-79e0-9591-d386e30fc22a","create_time":1793003936.2678936,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf11a0441481a0a1c68a2e04a5ae81","turn_id":"01a17747-5c00-79e0-9591-d386e30fc22a","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a1775c-f381-7121-9f5b-7fa61903e8f2","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":18627}}
