{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T09:33:19.434Z","ordinal":381187,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a1778e-a4c9-7752-b39a-7c0b39976780","call_id":"call_a8c00f764910425ab4f535b903a6efa2","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.8 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"---\n{\"agent\":\"KimiCode-defect-scan\",\"branch\":\"v1/defect-upgrade-tui-contamination-20261026\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/upgrade-tui-contamination\",\"since\":\"2026-10-26T09:10:00Z\",\"scope\":\"One bounded retry for idempotent download connection resets only after red regression; preserve checksum/origin/security and no retry for HTTP errors.\"}\n---\n{\"agent\":\"KimiCode-defect-scan\",\"branch\":\"v1/defect-upgrade-tui-contamination-20261026\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/upgrade-tui-contamination\",\"since\":\"2026-10-26T09:10:00Z\",\"scope\":\"Direct connection-reset download retry regression only.\"}\n---\n{\"agent\":\"KimiCode-defect-scan\",\"branch\":\"v1/defect-upgrade-tui-contamination-20261026\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/upgrade-tui-contamination\",\"since\":\"2026-10-26T07:40:00Z\",\"scope\":\"Temporary local fetch diagnostics then targeted test fixture/isolation fix only.\"}\n---\n{\"agent\":\"KimiCode-defect-scan\",\"branch\":\"v1/defect-upgrade-tui-contamination-20261026\",\"worktree\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/upgrade-tui-contamination\",\"base\":\"bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752\",\"since\":\"2026-10-26T07:40:00Z\",\"scope\":\"Diagnose harness.test -> upgrade_tui fetch contamination with local-only diagnostics, then minimal regression fix if root cause confirmed. No production behavior changes until evidence.\"}\n664:2026-10-25T07:23:00Z CLAIM_RELEASE DEFECT_EVAL_RESOURCE_ASSERTION_20261024 outcome=rebased_validated_ready_for_owner_integration head=17cc8f0\n666:2026-10-25T07:26:00Z CLAIM_RELEASE DEFECT_DOCTOR_SCHEMA2_JOURNAL_20261024 outcome=rebased_validated_ready_for_owner_i