{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T09:49:36.985Z","ordinal":381779,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1775d-5aef-7821-840a-9ebca31e58cd","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-252282ce-a6b9-4b5d-8a9b-9ba5584070d6","process_id":"27871","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 248 --json body,commits,mergeCommit,mergedAt,statusCheckRollup && gh run list --branch main --limit 8 --json databaseId,headSha,name,status,conclusion,createdAt,url && git show origin/main:cli/src/upgrade.ts | rg -n -C 3 'release-assets|allowed.*origin|redirect|github.com'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 248 --json body,commits,mergeCommit,mergedAt,statusCheckRollup && gh run list --branch main --limit 8 --json databaseId,headSha,name,status,conclusion,createdAt,url && git show origin/main:cli/src/upgrade.ts | rg -n -C 3 'release-assets|allowed.*origin|redirect|github.com'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"body\":\"## Summary\\n\\nFix the RC6-to-RC7 upgrade failure caused by GitHub redirecting the canonical release URL to a short-lived signed asset URL. The installer now accepts only HTTPS redirects to the exact `release-assets.githubusercontent.com/github-production-release-asset/` path, keeps manual redirect validation, and does not forward GitHub credentials to the asset host. Error diagnostics report only the origin, never signed query parameters.\\n\\nPre-migration backups now report bounded aggregate progress and sync directory entries once per copied directory while retaining per-file fsync and fail-closed backup handling. This makes large backups observable and reduces repeated directory sync overhead.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- `upgrade_safety.test.ts`: 35/35 passed, including the canonical GitHub-to-signed-asset redirect, credential isolation, and successful payload write.\\n- `upgrade_transaction_recovery.test.ts`: 47/47 passed.\\n- TypeScript typecheck and CLI build passed; generated `cli/dist` remained clean.\\n- Requirements enforcement and version synchronization passed on the clean candidate tree.\\n- Independent source and test review: ACCEPT.\\n\\nExact-head CI is required before integration. This change does not establish RC acceptance; the correctly versioned next RC must be built and qualified after integration.\\n\",\"commits\":[{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-26T03:17:00Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-26T03:17:01Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"fix: handle signed release download redirects\",\"oid\":\"64c22d3e6fc20c36432946abc8e237017d4b91be\"},{\"authoredDate\":\"2026-10-26T04:07:59Z\",\"authors\":[{\"email\":\"mike@holownych.com\",\"id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTE3ODA=\",\"login\":\"mikeholownych\",\"name\":\"Mike Holownych\"}],\"committedDate\":\"2026-10-26T04:07:59Z\",\"messageBody\":\"\",\"messageHeadline\":\"test: cover signed GitHub release asset redirects\",\"oid\":\"1cce2f48af32633cf9b3df36aa9c37ec4c2fce6f\"}],\"mergeCommit\":{\"oid\":\"a7880b64c98d5f3f6522a18a97b2a10489f9461e\"},\"mergedAt\":\"2026-10-26T04:59:56Z\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T04:33:58Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40268345732/job/121395534623\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T04:18:01Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-26T04:19:27Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40268345738/job/121395534684\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-26T04:18:01Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\