{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T09:50:22.787Z","ordinal":381804,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1775d-5aef-7821-840a-9ebca31e58cd","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf225b501081a0af438fba40816f78","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"That confirms the failure: **RC6 rejected GitHub’s signed release-asset redirect while downloading RC7**. PR [#248](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/248) fixed the redirect validation and safer error reporting. The fix is included in RC8, but **not RC7**; the RC8 tag contains the fix’s merge commit.\n\nThe failed attempt happened during download, after the backup step. Check `nexus --version` on mike-dev to confirm which version is still active. Don’t retry the RC7 upgrade from RC6; use the RC8 release installer instead. It installs side by side and switches the `nexus` link only after verifying the package.\n\nOn mike-dev:\n\n```sh\nmkdir -p \"$HOME/.cache/nexus-rc8\"\ngh release download v1.0.0-rc.8 -R mikeholownych/nexus-code \\\n  -p install.sh -p SHA256SUMS \\\n  -D \"$HOME/.cache/nexus-rc8\"\n\ncd \"$HOME/.cache/nexus-rc8\"\ngrep '  install.sh$' SHA256SUMS | sha256sum --check\n\nNEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.8 NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1 \\\n  sh \"$HOME/.cache/nexus-rc8/install.sh\"\n\nnexus --version\n```\n\nThe installer is also pinned by the published checksum; its SHA-256 is `5620d56ef6f8d637fc102ae2c8ea3b055effbc4069243a2df68b67520b1e2302`. Keep the backup for now. This upgrade issue is resolved in RC8; it does **not** mean RC8 or v1.0.0 has passed overall acceptance."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793008219340,"completed_at_ms":1793008222787}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T09:50:22.791Z","ordinal":381805,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf225b501081a0af438fba40816f78","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"That confirms the failure: **RC6 rejected GitHub’s signed release-asset redirect while downloading RC7**. PR [#248](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/248) fixed the redirect validation and safer error reporting. The fix is included in RC8, but **not RC7**; the RC8 tag contains the fix’s merge commit.\n\nThe failed attempt happened during download, after the backup step. Check `nexus --version` on mike-dev to confirm which version is still active. Don’t retry the RC7 upgrade from RC6; use the RC8 release installer instead. It installs side by side and switches the `nexus` link only after verifying the package.\n\nOn mike-dev:\n\n```sh\nmkdir -p \"$HOME/.cache/nexus-rc8\"\ngh release download v1.0.0-rc.8 -R mikeholownych/nexus-code \\\n  -p install.sh -p SHA256SUMS \\\n  -D \"$HOME/.cache/nexus-rc8\"\n\ncd \"$HOME/.cache/nexus-rc8\"\ngrep '  install.sh$' SHA256SUMS | sha256sum --check\n\nNEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.8 NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1 \\\n  sh \"$HOME/.cache/nexus-rc8/install.sh\"\n\nnexus --version\n```\n\nThe installer is also pinned by the published checksum; its SHA-256 is `5620d56ef6f8d637fc102ae2c8ea3b055effbc4069243a2df68b67520b1e2302`. Keep the backup for now. This upgrade issue is resolved in RC8; it does **not** mean RC8 or v1.0.0 has passed overall acceptance.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1775d-5aef-7821-840a-9ebca31e58cd","create_time":1793008219.3146415,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf225b501081a0af438fba40816f78","turn_id":"01a1775d-5aef-7821-840a-9ebca31e58cd","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a1779e-4247-7a60-81e