{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T09:57:53.331Z","ordinal":382012,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1779e-a8db-7503-bc94-b7b09b7a2beb","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf241f3f7c81a081d165c63b8063a4","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"**Campaign remains active; acceptance is still in progress.** No stable v1.0.0 release is accepted or published.\n\nThe RC7 upgrade error is explained: RC6 rejected GitHub’s signed asset redirect. The fix from PR #248 is in RC8, not RC7. I verified the RC8 installer checksum, but did not install it or change the shared checkout.\n\nCurrent integration is `e9304b1`. Its CodeQL and Node 22/24 checks pass; Linux packaging is still running the full CLI suite. PR #253’s Node checks pass and its Linux job is building. PR #252’s Node checks pass, but its Linux suite is running and it is still based on the older RC8 commit. I’ll wait for these checks to finish before integrating or rebasing.\n\nThe held-out corpus remains blocked: Issue #1 has no custodian response, and qualification has not started. The real terminal matrix is also incomplete. A remote read-only check of mike-dev stopped at a changed SSH host key; I did not bypass the check or modify host trust.\n\nThe signed download URL in the error was temporary; its stated expiry has passed. Avoid reposting it."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793008671659,"completed_at_ms":1793008673331}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T09:57:53.336Z","ordinal":382013,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf241f3f7c81a081d165c63b8063a4","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"**Campaign remains active; acceptance is still in progress.** No stable v1.0.0 release is accepted or published.\n\nThe RC7 upgrade error is explained: RC6 rejected GitHub’s signed asset redirect. The fix from PR #248 is in RC8, not RC7. I verified the RC8 installer checksum, but did not install it or change the shared checkout.\n\nCurrent integration is `e9304b1`. Its CodeQL and Node 22/24 checks pass; Linux packaging is still running the full CLI suite. PR #253’s Node checks pass and its Linux job is building. PR #252’s Node checks pass, but its Linux suite is running and it is still based on the older RC8 commit. I’ll wait for these checks to finish before integrating or rebasing.\n\nThe held-out corpus remains blocked: Issue #1 has no custodian response, and qualification has not started. The real terminal matrix is also incomplete. A remote read-only check of mike-dev stopped at a changed SSH host key; I did not bypass the check or modify host trust.\n\nThe signed download URL in the error was temporary; its stated expiry has passed. Avoid reposting it.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1779e-a8db-7503-bc94-b7b09b7a2beb","create_time":1793008671.6402762,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf241f3f7c81a081d165c63b8063a4","turn_id":"01a1779e-a8db-7503-bc94-b7b09b7a2beb","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a177a5-2238-7da1-b0e3-956fcfb4fb04","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":18752}}
