r task.\n4207:2026-10-26T01:47:00Z RELEASE CLOUD: RC7 installed ChatGPT provider verify PASS on ubuntu-desktop with gpt-6-luna; 3/3 streamed/tool/result steps, no workspace content, exact archive SHA256=367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a, source=431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1; sanitized evidence commit 1ce1ff9 based on current main 62e541c; credentials not exposed; OpenRouter remains disconnected; claims released.\n4246:2026-10-26T02:50:00Z CLAIM CLOUD agent=codex-root host=ubuntu-desktop artifact=v1.0.0-rc.7/431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1 scope=OpenRouter pinned verify + one small isolated live task\n4311:2026-10-26T07:58:41Z RELEASE_RECONCILIATION CLOUD: shared claim still names codex-root on ubuntu-desktop for RC7 E5 OpenRouter verify/live task. From mike-dev, SSH alias ubuntu-desktop is unresolved; remote boot identity/process/cwd could not be verified. No takeover or duplicate provider run. Claim remains owned/unresolved pending reachable host or explicit release.\n4319:2026-10-26T08:12:40Z COORDINATION_ATTEMPT CLOUD: sent status/handoff reconciliation to the recorded release coordinator Codex thread 01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92; transport failed at local MCP endpoint before delivery. No message delivery claimed and no ownership changed. Shared claim remains authoritative/unresolved; do not duplicate E5.\n# Running multiple agents on this plan without collisions\n\nThese rules apply to every agent (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Nexus itself, or a human) that implements any part of this package at the same time as another. The repository's root `AGENTS.md` points here. The rules come from incidents recorded in `tasks/lessons.md`:\n\n- a concurrent agent overwrote newer evidence;\n- full test suites were contaminated by edits made mid-run;\n- `pkill -f` killed the agent's own shell;\n- HEAD moved during a pause.\n\nThey also follow from audit finding PER-03: the test suite writes into the real `~/.nexus`.\n\