ve as of 2026-10-26T10:12:59Z.\",\n  \"postmerge_readiness_ci\": \"main CI40300214592 and CodeQL40300214410 status pending/currently running\",\n  \"current_main\": \"e9304b1cafa629a999e9165977588c9524a4d9da\",\n  \"current_main_requirements\": \"PASS: 123 rows, 12 explicit exact-RC deferrals, verified on detached snapshot with isolated HOME/XDG\",\n  \"current_main_version\": \"PASS: all components 1.0.0-rc.8\",\n  \"postmerge_main\": \"CI40300214592 still active in linux-x86_64 npm test; CodeQL40300214410 SUCCESS\"\n}\n\nRecent coordination entries:\n2026-10-26T09:03:39Z SUITE_RELEASE codex-root explicit-scope verifier regression exit=0 snapshot=/var/tmp/nexus-discovered-verifier-snapshot.PqKAFh log=/var/tmp/nexus-discovered-verifier-snapshot.PqKAFh/explicit-scope-run.log\n2026-10-26T09:04:07Z Acquired SUITE atomically for independent_verification.test.ts plus pre-mutation regression; shell PID 918502.\n2026-10-26T09:05:48Z SUITE_RELEASE codex-root independent_verification+premutation exit=0 snapshot=/var/tmp/nexus-discovered-verifier-snapshot.PqKAFh log=/var/tmp/nexus-discovered-verifier-snapshot.PqKAFh/independent-verification-run.log\n2026-10-26T09:07:31Z CLAIM_RELEASE FILE_docs_reviews_evidence_v1_defect-discovered-verifier-baseline exit=0 evidence retained on branch v1/defect-discovered-verifier-baseline.\n2026-10-26T09:08:58Z INDEPENDENT_REVIEW DEFECT_DISCOVERED_VERIFIER_BASELINE ACCEPT; exact source/test hashes and 35/35 focused regression run verified by rc5_candidate_review; tracked diff SHA-256 46e6d370787d72eb2c6d350c89abe78bd6575ac9332a087c3591f87fd188e4d6; branch v1/defect-discovered-verifier-baseline at base bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752.\n2026-10-26T09:08:58Z LOCAL_COMMIT DEFECT_DISCOVERED_VERIFIER_BASELINE 61f687896b5fd3682688ff477f9f3b54aecce28d; exact reviewed changes committed in /home/mike/nexus-wt/defect-discovered-verifier-baseline; no push performed under concurrency owner boundary.\n2026-10-26T09:13:27Z SUITE_RELEASE codex-root N