{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:29:56.674Z","ordinal":383164,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a177bf-4620-7ab3-b4dc-70b0c8b8dcf2","turn_id":"01a177bf-4620-7ab3-b4dc-70b0c8b8dcf2","last_agent_message":"**Main is still running the Node 22 and Node 24 CLI suites on `1434a93`; CodeQL passed.** I verified the run is active, so I’m preserving the suite boundary and haven’t pushed or started checks for PR #252.\n\nPR #252 remains independently accepted at local head `561b8d1`, rebased on `1434a93`, with a clean diff. Once main CI is terminal, I’ll push that candidate and start its exact-head checks.\n\nThe custodian issue remains unanswered. The RC8 interactive task still awaits your folder-trust choice, and the manual terminal matrix has no recorded cells yet. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**; RC8 is still a prerelease.","started_at":1793010386,"completed_at":1793010596,"duration_ms":210201,"time_to_first_token_ms":2483}}
