{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:29:59.001Z","ordinal":383170,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a177c2-7b4a-7152-ba84-5c8470f48393","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf2ba660b081a0805473c1b17f4c85","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’m checking the exact main workflow again. If its Node suites have finished successfully, I’ll publish the already-reviewed PR #252 rebase and proceed with its exact-head gates; if not, I’ll inspect the live job state and keep other independent qualification lanes moving."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793010598406,"completed_at_ms":1793010599001}}
