{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:32:51.013Z","ordinal":383253,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a177c2-7b4a-7152-ba84-5c8470f48393","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-022ae306-713b-4f1d-9ff4-d7eafa3a35e2","process_id":"92906","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh issue view 1 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json title,assignees,labels,author,body,comments --jq '\"title=\"+.title+\" author=\"+.author.login+\" assignees=\"+([.assignees[].login]|join(\",\"))+\" labels=\"+([.labels[].name]|join(\",\"))+\"\\n\"+(.body|.[0:1000])'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh issue view 1 --repo mikeholownych/nexus-code --json title,assignees,labels,author,body,comments --jq '\"title=\"+.title+\" author=\"+.author.login+\" assignees=\"+([.assignees[].login]|join(\",\"))+\" labels=\"+([.labels[].name]|join(\",\"))+\"\\n\"+(.body|.[0:1000])'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"title=PLAN-10 task 8: finish and seal the held-out T2/T3 corpus author=mikeholownych assignees= labels=v1.0.0\n## Scope\nComplete PLAN-10 task 8 without using held-out tasks for tuning. The isolated authoring lane currently reports 4/20 required distinct repository-arm tasks validated, 4 more in validation drafts, and a remaining gap to the 20-task repository-arm minimum. The 40-task T2 corpus must still meet the accepted class/language distribution and include at least 20 externally sourced tasks; the separate 8-task T3 set is also required.\n\n## Acceptance\n- Freeze the task population, fixtures, validators, and manifests before RC qualification.\n- Validate every required task with independent validators; retain failures and environment limitations.\n- Establish custody separate from authoring and candidate development; do not claim independent holdout acceptance until the custodian approves and seals it.\n- Record digests, provenance, contamination declarations, and license/source evidence.\n- Update REQ-QUAL-101 only after its accepted criteria are met.\n\nReferences: `docs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-10-v1-\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":71243971}},"started_at_ms":1793010769941,"completed_at_ms":1793010771013}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:32:52.173Z","ordinal":383254,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a177c5-28cd-7f80-a310-5205eb6ebea2","call_id":"call_26517a9d3a634d46ab164009bf3375b2","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.4 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"title=PLAN-10 task 8: finish and seal the held-out T2/T3 corpus author=mikeholownych assignees= labels=v1.0.0\n## Scope\nComplete PLAN-10 task 8 without using held-out tasks for tuning. The isolated authoring lane currently reports 4/20 required distinct repository-arm tasks validated, 4 more in validation drafts, and a remaining gap to the 20-task repository-arm minimum. The 40-task T2 corpus must still meet the accepted class/language distribution and include at least 20 externally sourced tasks; the separate 8-task T3 set is also required.\n\n## Acceptance\n- Freeze the task population, fixtures, validators, and manifests before RC qualification.\n- Validate every required task with independent validators; retain failures and environment limitations.\n- Establish custody separate from authoring and candidate development; do not claim independent holdout acceptance until the custodian approves and seals it.\n- Record digests, provenance, contamination declarations, and license/source evidence.\n- Update REQ-QUAL-101 only after its accepted criteria are met.\n\nReferences: `docs/v1.0.0/plans/PLAN-10-v1-\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a177c2-7b4a-7152-ba84-5c8470f48393","create_time":1793010772.1730633}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
