kpoint=PR142 at 34b8cea has accepted stale-status correction but is based on 8935918; refresh to 44ca13d after current postmerge CI/CodeQL terminal and rerun exact checks., custody_dependency=Issue #1 latest public response still coordinator-authored 2026-10-23T03:46:59Z; no custodian status reply. Agent Mail project home-mike-nexus-code currently lists zero window identities. T2/T3 custody acceptance, evaluator-compatible immutable T2, and independent custodian evidence remain unavailable; no private material accessed and no qualification started., stable_release=No accepted RC and no stable release; Issue #1 custody response absent and T2 qualification not started., pr140=MERGED 2026-10-22 08:22:14Z at 44ca13d58a262b5f89be459b47aefa50c2d61683. Exact PR CI39743451659 SUCCESS: Node20/22/24 and linux-x86_64 package/repro/smoke/install/security/requirements; CodeQL39743451782 SUCCESS; independent review ACCEPT; report is synt…1456 tokens truncated…ependent ACCEPT from plan05_readonly_review. All 15 terminal/size combinations, per-cell verdict/evidence/screenshot refs, §5.3 procedures and safety gate; blank installed RC identity/digest; automated PTY explicitly excluded. Diff-check PASS, no tests. Both claims released at 2026-10-23T00:08:45Z; branch/worktree retained for integration., node22_focused_test=On combined candidate 81f4c8a8911e057470aad9b71210b9a1619c64b7, `npm ci --prefix cli` PASS and `node --import tsx --test test/node_floor.test.ts` from cli/ PASS 6/6 under isolated HOME, Node24.11.1/npm10.8.2; diff-check clean. Initial incorrect root loader invocation failed before tests and is recorded as invocation error., pr148_linux_job=PR148 CI run39829432189 Node20/22/24 matrices all SUCCESS; CodeQL run39829432308 SUCCESS; linux-x86_64 job120010039920 remains in apt-get update/install step, no failure conclusion. SUITE still held., node22_candidate_latest=Final ledger follow-up head c638da0dbf6c3cc42069b3bce02b0f679eba4a90 pushed. It updates stale REQ-REL-003 evid