{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:43:05.322Z","ordinal":383644,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a177c2-7b4a-7152-ba84-5c8470f48393","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf2eb87b1081a0899c23a1bdcc7dde","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I confirmed the failure matches the old RC7 code path: its URL allowlist rejects GitHub’s `release-assets.githubusercontent.com` redirect. The fix shipped in RC8, so retrying `nexus upgrade` from RC6 will keep failing until RC8 is installed by a separate bootstrap path. I’m checking the published installer instructions so I can give you the right command for `mike-dev`, where the upgrade actually ran."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793011384512,"completed_at_ms":1793011385322}}
