{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T10:43:25.657Z","ordinal":383662,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a177c2-7b4a-7152-ba84-5c8470f48393","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf2ecb98b881a0bfe4c7060611b971","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"That confirms the RC6 → RC7 upgrade failure: RC6 rejects GitHub’s signed asset redirect. The fix is in RC8, so retrying the upgrade from RC6 won’t work.\n\nTo bootstrap RC8, run its pinned installer **on mike-dev (10.0.8.95)**:\n\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/v1.0.0-rc.8/install.sh \\\n  | NEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.8 sh\n```\n\nIt verifies the release checksum before switching the `nexus` link. If `gh` is installed at `/usr/bin/gh` or `/usr/local/bin/gh`, the installer also attempts provenance verification; GitHub authentication on Ubuntu does not carry over to mike-dev. After installation, check `nexus --version`, then RC8 can handle later upgrades.\n\nThe error URL contained a short-lived signed download token, which has expired. Avoid sharing signed asset URLs; the command above obtains a fresh one."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793011403628,"completed_at_ms":1793011405657}}
