HOME/.config\\\" XDG_DATA_HOME=\\\"$HOME/.local/share\\\" XDG_STATE_HOME=\\\"$HOME/.local/state\\\" XDG_CACHE_HOME=\\\"$HOME/.cache\\\" export CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\\\"$SNAP/core/target\\\" cd \\\"$SNAP\\\" { npm ci --prefix cli; make build; make test; } 2>&1 | tee \\\"$SNAP/rebased-validation.log\\\"\\n1161719 make test\\n1170858 npm test\\n1248338 /usr/bin/zsh -c cat .git/nexus-claims/SUITE/owner.json 2>/dev/null; pgrep -af 'npm (ci|test)|make (test|build)|cargo test|package-linux' | head -30; tail -30 nexus-claims.log 2>/dev/null\\n\"}}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"R140 host report is synthetic-only; current evaluator blocks legacy hidden.command qualification; issue remains open on custodian-compatible immutable corpus and custody acceptance. No private material accessed., issue2_t4_reconciled=Posted update to issue #2 at 2026-10-22T22:47Z: current main a4a7 has ACCEPTANCE §6.2 and PLAN-10 task11 both at 9x5; old 8x5 run estimate is explicitly historical. T4 itself remains unrun., postmerge_requirements=PASS exact detached worktree main@1da67c3, isolated HOME/XDG; 123 rows 108 tested/6 partial/2 implemented/7 open; 12 mapped to exact-RC qualification, post_merge_ci=SUCCESS exact main 1f3c655971ade086f55347926db16cf2ecd52d1f: CI39957281380 Node22/24 and Linux package/repro/SBOM/smoke/installer all pass; CodeQL39957281390 pass., post_merge_codeql=39874058549 still running exact main@1da67c3, node22_floor=PR150 integrated; active source policy now >=22; requirements partial rows remain honestly deferred to exact-RC gates, updated_at=2026-10-22T23:47Z, readiness_update=Recovered PR152 worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/plan10-readiness-after-node22 on mike-dev after reboot; clean at b7ffdbd and remote matched. Addressed both exact-head review findings, pushed 1784a927eeb9682d7dc77d09619d3e1771f22d97. Documentation assertions and diff-check pass. Exact PR152 CI run39877883456 and CodeQL39877883542 queued; independent read-only re-review requested. Next: await exact-head checks/review, resolve any findings, merge via required protected PR path only after gates, verify post-merge main, resume release gates., superseded_prs=PR137 and PR146 closed as superseded by PR150 integration; Node22 claims and hot-file claims released and logged, terminal_matrix_integration=Accepted worksheet commit 33732a3 incorporated via cherry-pick as 2b36561 on readiness PR branch v1/plan10-readiness-after-node22 after subagent released claims. New FILE_ claim acquired; readiness slice scope extended and logged. No tests/push yet; current main SUITE claim remains active., readiness_review=Independent ACCEPT of readiness-only diff against exact 1a484c3; commit b544d65659c6a74d15877d7be50f06bf51132574 prepared locally, go_toolchain_lane=PR133 merged as dea199d; current main 1da67c3 includes merge; exact source CI39665020828 and CodeQL39665020779 passed on branch head 6f52295; only agent-local targeted Go test not run because Go absent, with full hosted suite passing; no remaining lane blocker., pr152_current=Exact PR head 4e95707be884c94aa6d3f8e360a1719e47b6e265; independent review ACCEPT; CodeQL 39878298342 SUCCESS; required Node22/24 full CI run39878298329 remains in npm CLI tests, no failure and hosted jobs active. Superseded ee5db3d run canceled., pr152_progress=Exact head 4e95707: Node24 CLI suite SUCCESS; Node22 CLI suite still in progress; CodeQL SUCCESS; independent source review ACCEPT. Wait for Node22 terminal and protected merge eligibility., pr152_ci_progress=Exact head deaf56f; CodeQL passed; independent review ACCEPT. Node22/24 full CLI suites remain active, no failure. Next wait current CI, then protected merge if PR head/base unchanged., readiness_pr152=MERGED 2026-10-23T01:38:01Z as fa16045a6351ce61763bc3fcc93b562c50849285. Exact PR head deaf56f CI39881805268 all three jobs SUCCESS (Node22, Node24, Linux x86_64 package/repro/smoke/install); CodeQL39881805274 SUCCESS; independent review ACCEPT; source docs consistency/diff-check PASS; claims released. Post-merge main CI39885102002 and CodeQL39885101945 queued; verify before exact-main requirements enforcement and RC3 prep., rc3_candidate_review=Independent reviewer plan05_readonly_review ACCEPT exact ba885bdcd6f6e0afdbb2631afcc0cfb2af2896a8 against fa16045a6351ce61763bc3fcc93b562c50849285. Version/lockfile synchronization and release note accurate; no tests run by reviewer; no tag/release created; installed-candidate checks still required., rc1_checkpoint_disposition=Installed global nexus --version reports 1.0.0-rc.1 commit cb364c386c42. RC1 is immutable and predates PR147 checkpoint-choice flow, so the user's repeated failure is expected on RC1. Current main source includes the five-choice workflow and candidate ba885bd includes it by ancestry; exact installed candidate proof pending source CI and approved gates., rc1_checkpoint_root_cause=Verified from immutable tag source and installed executable: global `nexus` is 1.0.0-rc.1 at cb364c386c42faa53b67e04cacc81d7e01520779; RC1 sidecar catch at cli/src/sidecar.ts immediately emits INTERNAL and returns on checkpoint error. Fix commit 0bd67d962d3885c22294ba655485556b858f3b9c is not an ancestor of RC1 but is an ancestor of RC3 candidate ba885bd. Current code prompts five choices: read-only, continue without rollback checkpoint, create checkpoint despite sensitive persistence, cancel, re-enter instruction. Exact main postmerge CodeQL39885101945 SUCCESS; CI39885102002 still running Node22/24 CLI tests under exclusive SUITE claim., repl_checkpoint_choices=Exact candidate head 250dd96ab34ced55b6a27741f458dc98082b684c based on fa16045. Independent review ACCEPT by plan05_readonly_review: read-only choice clearly applies current turn and configured mode resumes only after later safe checkpoint; all ordinary/history/paste/image turn paths use prompt; explicit --read-only bypasses checkpoint creation; all five choices and invalid-choice reprompt retained. Tests remain unrun because exact-main CI39885102002 still IN_PROGRESS Node22/24, SUITE owner is /root. Next poll that run; when terminal, release SUITE, run focused tests under isolated HOME, address any findings, then request exact-head CI/review and integrate., main_CI_progress=Exact main fa16045 run39885102002: Node22/24 full suites SUCCESS; Linux cargo deny/tests/release build and Linux npm CLI suite SUCCESS; now package-linux.sh in progress. CodeQL39885101945 SUCCESS. SUITE remains held through packaging/repro/smoke/install terminal., readiness_post152_pr=PR #154 opened at c033b38dedd89904cbe3f311e5cd11229fd5ecb7 against fa16045. It refreshes only current readiness and adds exact-main fa16045 postmerge CI/CodeQL and requirements output; prior checkpoints byte-identical. Documentation consistency assertions and diff-check pass. Independent review and exact-head CI pending., pr153_update=origin/main remains fa16045a6351ce61763bc3fcc93b562c50849285 and PR153 exact head 250dd96ab34ced55b6a27741f458dc98082b684c. CodeQL SUCCESS; setup, version, requirements source gate, cargo tests, release build, tools install all SUCCESS in both Node22/24 jobs. Both CLI suites still IN_PROGRESS. PR blocked pending exact checks; no merge. Continue monitoring., pr153_current=Exact head 250dd96: CodeQL, Node22, Node24 SUCCESS. Linux job passed setup/requirements/Rust test/build and is executing full CLI tests after starting package lane. PR154 readiness docs PR run39888503589 also remains active on Node22/24 CLI tests; current SUITE owner.json says PR154 while append-only claim log records PR153 as the claim and no logged handoff. No local tests or additional suite execution started. Preserve current workflow evidence; resolve claim discrepancy before any new suite or post-merge workflow., checkpoint_fix_integrated=PR153 merged 2026-10-23T02:44:43Z; merge commit main 429bd3141b422ca38df19745d733588cc92901c4, includes independently accepted REPL prompt parity fix. Exact PR head 250dd96 CI39888390485 SUCCESS (Node22, Node24, Linux package/repro/CLI suite); CodeQL39888390479 SUCCESS; focused 4/4; requirements enforcement passed on base fa16045. Post-merge main CI39891244410 and CodeQL39891244389 active on exact merge commit. PR154 readiness documentation remains open at c033b38 on old base fa16045; old exact checks in Linux packaging stage, and refresh is needed after current main CI. No RC tag or release., pr154=Merged as 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. Post-merge CodeQL 39891501527 SUCCESS, Node22/24 CI SUCCESS, Linux CI 39891501513 still in npm cli test at 2026-10-23 03:14 UTC. Coordination log latest confirms SUITE claim released after independent focused tests (5/5) on PR155 lane; do not start full local suite while hosted Linux test active. PR155 exact head 76b34f1d18d766b06011176a85679e7c3434ba30 against main 382e018; independent ACCEPT; CodeQL pass; Node 22/24 checks running. Issue #1 remains open; latest comment remains metadata-only request 2026-10-22T22:08:34Z; no custodian response., doctor_d1b_candidate=Uncommitted change in isolated worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/doctor-integrity-scan, branch v1/doctor-integrity-scan, base 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. State scan now lstat batches capped at 128; regression test instruments 512 records and delays lstat 20ms to expose serial-timeout behavior. diff-check PASS. Tests queued until SUITE release; independent read-only review requested., current_ci=39891501513 on exact main 382e018 in_progress Node22/24 CLI test. 39891501527 CodeQL SUCCESS. Prior merge CI39891244410 on 429bd314 Node22/24 SUCCESS, linux setup active; not merged-head evidence for current main., doctor_root_cause_reconciled=Current main includes PR151: D1 event-loop starvation fixed, D2 index/schema2 false warning fixed, D3 unlisted gateway model now advisory with --deep verification. Remaining measured D1b: async serial lstat over 53,376 entries still makes integrity.check exceed 5s and warn. Focused concurrent-batch fix underway; not yet tested., doctor_d1b_pr=PR #155 opened at https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/155; head 76b34f1d18d766b06011176a85679e7c3434ba30, base 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. Independent review ACCEPT. Focused doctor tests 5/5 and tsc --noEmit pass. Exact PR CI run39893335185 and CodeQL39893335167 in progress. No merge yet., main_latest_ci=Run39891501513 exact main 382e018: Node22 and Node24 full suites SUCCESS; Linux package job still in progress. CodeQL39891501527 SUCCESS. Prior PR153 post-merge run39891244410 on\n[Response shortened; request fewer selected records for more detail.]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a177cf-42cc-7823-a07a-666f72e7f9a8","create_time":1793011448.5028415}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
