{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T11:40:23.005Z","ordinal":385157,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a177fe-59d7-78d1-b754-fee944e5993b","turn_id":"01a177fe-59d7-78d1-b754-fee944e5993b","last_agent_message":"**Campaign remains active; acceptance is still IN_PROGRESS.**\n\n- **Source gates:** `main@1434a93ba32a5cbfa128a2007cf43bd5449a6725` has passing exact-head CI and CodeQL.\n- **PR #252:** Independent review returned **ACCEPT** for head `561b8d1` against that base. Node 22, Node 24, and CodeQL pass; the Linux package job is still running `npm --prefix cli test`. I’m holding the next full-suite PR until that job finishes.\n- **CodeQL alerts:** Alerts 48 and 49 remain open. Their fix is committed locally, independently reviewed, and passed its focused test; it is queued for full CI after PR #252.\n- **RC status:** RC8 is a published prerelease, not an accepted candidate. Exact-RC qualification remains incomplete.\n- **Still gated:** Held-out custody has not responded; no held-out run has started. The 15-cell human terminal matrix has not been run. The SUITE claim remains protected under Kimi’s ownership; I did not start an overlapping suite.\n\nThe `mike-dev` upgrade error is consistent with RC7 rejecting GitHub’s signed download redirect. I also confirmed SSH now reports a changed host key for that machine, so I left the connection untouched rather than bypassing identity verification.","started_at":1793014520,"completed_at":1793014823,"duration_ms":302715,"time_to_first_token_ms":4018}}
