{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T11:46:33.783Z","ordinal":385410,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17802-f864-7383-97fc-4fdd2f0a5d6e","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-cf1215a1-8fa1-47cd-a217-db182efe6393","process_id":"21102","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=5 mike@10.0.8.3 '\"$HOME/.local/bin/nexus\" providers verify --help; printf \"%s\\n\" \"--- provider status ---\"; \"${HOME}/.local/bin/nexus\" providers' "],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=5 mike@10.0.8.3 '\"$HOME/.local/bin/nexus\" providers verify --help; printf \"%s\\n\" \"--- provider status ---\"; \"${HOME}/.local/bin/nexus\" providers' "}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"Usage: nexus providers verify [options]\n\nLive check: streamed completion and a tool round trip against a provider (sends\nno workspace content)\n\nOptions:\n  --provider <id>     Provider to check\n  -m, --model <name>  Model id (default: $NEXUS_MODEL)\n  --base-url <url>    Override the provider's base URL\n  -j, --json          Print steps and receipts as JSON\n  -h, --help          display help for command\n--- provider status ---\n\nCloud inference providers\n\n  openrouter  openai-chat         https://openrouter.ai\n              connected via OpenRouter sign-in\n  openai      openai-responses    https://api.openai.com\n              not connected ($OPENAI_API_KEY or nexus connect openai)\n  anthropic   anthropic-messages  https://api.anthropic.com\n              not connected ($ANTHROPIC_API_KEY or nexus connect anthropic)\n  chatgpt     openai-responses    https://chatgpt.com\n              connected via Codex CLI  · unofficial sign-in\n  copilot     openai-chat         https://api.githubcopilot.com\n              not connected (nexus connect copilot)  · unofficial sign-in\n  compatible  openai-chat         (set --base-url or NEXUS_COMPATIBLE_BASE_URL)\n              not connected ($NEXUS_COMPATIBLE_API_KEY or nexus connect compatible)\n\n[nexus] Inference — main: Local endpoint (http://localhost:1234) · local-model · local\nAuthorized cloud destinations: none\nSelect with --provider <id> --model <id> (or NEXUS_PROVIDER / NEXUS_MODEL in ~/.config/nexus/config.env).\n\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":308442948}},"started_at_ms":1793015192474,"completed_at_ms":1793015193783}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T11:46:35.401Z","ordinal":385411,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17808-a708-7722-908d-98fb6f945273","call_id":"call_3283e3594eec4cf58e37357a2294e19e","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 4.1 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Usage: nexus providers verify [options]\n\nLive check: streamed completion and a tool round trip against a provider (sends\nno workspace content)\n\nOptions:\n  --provider <id>     Provider to check\n  -m, --model <name>  Model id (default: $NEXUS_MODEL)\n  --base-url <url>    Override the provider's base URL\n  -j, --json          Print steps and receipts as JSON\n  -h, --help          display help for command\n--- provider status ---\n\nCloud inference providers\n\n  openrouter  openai-chat         https://openrouter.ai\n              connected via OpenRouter sign-in\n  openai      openai-responses    https://api.openai.com\n              not connected ($OPENAI_API_KEY or nexus connect openai)\n  anthropic   anthropic-messages  https://api.anthropic.com\n              not connected ($ANTHROPIC_API_KEY or nexus connect anthropic)\n  chatgpt     openai-responses    https://chatgpt.com\n              connected via Codex CLI  · unofficial sign-in\n  copilot     openai-chat         https://api.githubcopilot.com\n              not connected (nexus connect copilot)  · unofficial sign-in\n  compatible  openai-chat         (set --base-url or NEXUS_COMPATIBLE_BASE_URL)\n              not connected ($NEXUS_COMPATIBLE_API_KEY or nexus connect compatible)\n\n[nexus] Inference — main: Local endpoint (http://localhost:1234) · local-model · local\nAuthorized cloud destinations: none\nSelect with --provider <id> --model <id> (or NEXUS_PROVIDER / NEXUS_MODEL in ~/.config/nexus/config.env).\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17802-f864-7383-97fc-4fdd2f0a5d6e","create_time":1793015195.400899}},"metadata":{"client_a