{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T11:59:37.063Z","ordinal":385911,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17802-f864-7383-97fc-4fdd2f0a5d6e","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf40a81fcc81a0ac173b2701532d82","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The exact cause is confirmed: RC6/RC7 lack the signed-asset redirect allowlist; GitHub now redirects release downloads to `release-assets.githubusercontent.com`. The fix is in RC8 and current `main`, so this failure identifies the older installed updater, not a malformed URL. The requirements gate now passes on clean `main@7f52ed1`; current `main` CI is still running."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793015976347,"completed_at_ms":1793015977063}}
