{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:00:27.334Z","ordinal":385973,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17802-f864-7383-97fc-4fdd2f0a5d6e","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf40d9906881a09b33cad041c8f560","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"That confirms the upgrade failure: GitHub redirected the download to its signed asset host, and the RC6 updater rejected that host. RC7 has the same limitation. RC8 contains the fix, but an RC6 or RC7 installation may need the GitHub installer once to reach it.\n\nI verified the fix is in `v1.0.0-rc.8` and `origin/main`. Requirements enforcement passes on `main@7f52ed1`; post-merge CodeQL passed, while the Node 22/24 CI jobs are still running. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**.\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":15,"lineEnd":30,"note":"release claims require exact artifact and environment verification"}],"rolloutIds":["01a13629-7b99-7b61-a6e3-88bb4ac1dd15"]}},"started_at_ms":1793016025610,"completed_at_ms":1793016027334}}
