{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:01:16.558Z","ordinal":386000,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17815-c207-77b3-8d5e-f5b6ea16defd","session_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","root_turn_id":"01a17815-c207-77b3-8d5e-f5b6ea16defd","response_id":"resp_060b64278a9dfb15016adf41077b4081a0ade15d83828370fc","usage":{"input_tokens":119370,"cached_input_tokens":112768,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":386,"reasoning_output_tokens":369,"total_tokens":119756},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":344565,"cached_input_tokens":335104,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1312,"reasoning_output_tokens":993,"total_tokens":345877},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":7090754456,"cached_input_tokens":7015303680,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":20303400,"reasoning_output_tokens":11770959,"total_tokens":7111057856}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:01:17.491Z","ordinal":386001,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a17816-1cb3-7383-9e8a-76b3bbc07106","call_id":"call_53f4377fb37f47629d89b7430c8848d9","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT for REQ-REL-114 / ACC-SUP-08 on RC7 only.**\\n\\nWorkflow run [40248074777](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40248074777) completed successfully. It ran from reviewed workflow commit `1b741144a76fb32de75a750c966be611d0618f3c` and resolved `v1.0.0-rc.7` to source commit `431cb194931f09eaaffdb6880dc464c1d7b5e2a1`.\\n\\nThe Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04 builds used the pinned toolchains and exact RC source. The comparison job passed checksum validation and byte comparisons between both builds and the published RC for the archive and five selected packaging artifacts. The public RC7 archive digest is `367e9384e6de6df5801c3b015e7965becccb53b6b11ff94cf906da764724c58a`.\\n\\nThe downloaded evidence JSON matches the official workflow artifact byte-for-byte; its SHA-256 is `ffb14aeefe28f2fee3e90eae617a7ca3dc23ea0e90f121d38a432b6f286f9abc`.\\n\\nThis satisfies the cross-runner reproducibility gate for RC7. A later RC requires its own exact-tag run; this result does not establish overall RC acceptance.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/heldout_public_coverage_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Since the last audit, Issue #1 gained coordinator comment [#6406940449](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6406940449); the issue’s `updated_at` is `2026-10-26T02:33:48Z`. It says the custody request remains unanswered. All 20 comments are from the coordinator; no custodian response or handoff is visible.\\n\\nAt `main@bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, the T2 and T3 manifest hashes are unchanged: `50895b84…1f3e89b` and `85fb9caf…c9f1383`. The evaluator still rejects T2’s legacy `hidden.command` for qualification and requires custodian-led conversion or replacement, repeated custody checks, and a new immutable manifest.\\n\\nNo active held-out ownership or handoff appears in the claims records. The same external dependency remains; there is no new custody readiness.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"**ACCEPT** for head `561b8d133cf7833f6342be2b5e538418594bb0b3` against base `1434a93ba32a5cbfa128a2007cf43bd5449a6725`. Diff SHA-256: `4ec6bf20e722a47f66f45cc35759b2b48ec9d98f816fe300831f74610622eeae`.\\n\\nThe change captures the verifier baseline before workspace-mutating tools, including `run_command` and `spawn_subagent`. Both regressions exercise a previously failing test, make the first mutation through the relevant path, then assert the task is independently verified. The current source and test files match the recorded test snapshot by hash; no tests were run in this review.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17815-c207-77b3-8d5e-f5b6ea16defd","create_time":1793016077.4913547}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
