{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:04:18.096Z","ordinal":386106,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17818-de30-74b2-9c46-5872759173ac","call_id":"call_43d3bf8839584a5abd41f878f9d8f16c","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"mcp__mcp_search__get_observations\nStep 3: Fetch selected useful details for the IDs chosen after reviewing the index and timeline. Any shortening is marked. Params: ids (required), orderBy, limit, project (worker) or projectId (server\n\nmcp__mcp_search__observation_add\nInsert a manual observation directly into server storage. Calls /v1/memories — does NOT enqueue generation. Server runtime only. Params: content (required), projectId (optional, falls back to settings\n\nmcp__mcp_search__observation_context\nGet top-N relevant observations for context injection. Returns matched observations AND a pre-joined context string suitable for prompt injection. Calls /v1/context. Server runtime only. Omit \"query\" \n\nmcp__mcp_search__observation_generation_status\nLook up the status of an observation generation job by id. Calls /v1/jobs/:id. Server runtime only. Returns a concise job receipt. This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\n\nexec tool declaration:\n```\n\nmcp__mcp_search__observation_record_event\nRecord an agent event into the server. Calls /v1/events — server inserts the event row, the outbox row, and enqueues a generation job atomically. Server runtime only. This tool is part of plugin `clau\n\nmcp__mcp_search__observation_search\nSearch generated observations by keyword (Postgres full-text) and, when the server has search by meaning (pgvector, CLAUDE_MEM_SERVER_VECTOR_SEARCH), by meaning (embedding similarity), fused by recipr\n\nmcp__mcp_search__work_state_read\nRead this project's to-do lists and working state written with work_state_write: every open item, or one list, with done and dropped items when includeClosed is true. Params: list, includeClosed. This\n\nmcp__mcp_search__work_state_write\nYour canonical to-do list and working state for this project, kept across sessions: whatever is still open is shown at the start of every session. Each call appends one entry to a list. To-do item: fi"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17815-c207-77b3-8d5e-f5b6ea16defd","create_time":1793016258.096291}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
