{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:08:03.367Z","ordinal":386222,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17815-c207-77b3-8d5e-f5b6ea16defd","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf42a1ae7481a08a9358fc1bbf7213","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The error is explained: GitHub redirected the RC7 download to `release-assets.githubusercontent.com`, which the RC6 updater didn’t allow. The fix landed in [commit 64c22d3](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/commit/64c22d3) and is included in RC8.\n\nSince RC7 has the same limitation, updating from RC6 or RC7 to RC8 through `nexus upgrade` may hit this error again. A one-time install of RC8 through the GitHub installer is needed to get past it. GitHub sign-in is host-specific, so signing in on `ubuntu-desktop` does not sign in `mike-dev`.\n\nRelease gates remain in progress: on `main@7f52ed1`, requirements enforcement and CodeQL passed, Node 24 passed, and Node 22 CI is still running. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793016481748,"completed_at_ms":1793016483367}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:08:03.371Z","ordinal":386223,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf42a1ae7481a08a9358fc1bbf7213","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"The error is explained: GitHub redirected the RC7 download to `release-assets.githubusercontent.com`, which the RC6 updater didn’t allow. The fix landed in [commit 64c22d3](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/commit/64c22d3) and is included in RC8.\n\nSince RC7 has the same limitation, updating from RC6 or RC7 to RC8 through `nexus upgrade` may hit this error again. A one-time install of RC8 through the GitHub installer is needed to get past it. GitHub sign-in is host-specific, so signing in on `ubuntu-desktop` does not sign in `mike-dev`.\n\nRelease gates remain in progress: on `main@7f52ed1`, requirements enforcement and CodeQL passed, Node 24 passed, and Node 22 CI is still running. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17815-c207-77b3-8d5e-f5b6ea16defd","create_time":1793016481.6840024,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf42a1ae7481a08a9358fc1bbf7213","turn_id":"01a17815-c207-77b3-8d5e-f5b6ea16defd","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a1781c-4e2b-7f01-bfdf-ea9c58b40de9","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":18915}}
