Please confirm the currently assigned custodian, whether the sealed 40-task corpus can be qualified losslessly under the current evaluator or requires a newly versioned corpus, and the expected timing for the required custody acceptance and frozen run metadata. Please do not post task objectives, source payloads, validators, reference solutions, hidden results, or credentials here. No held-out execution has started.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"author\": \"mikeholownych\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-26T02:33:48Z\",\n      \"body\": \"Public metadata-only follow-up: current `origin/main` is `62e541c9e170a51d02420753f0807c14d65d7074`; its source CI and CodeQL have passed, and PR #246 is in exact-head CI after rebasing onto that commit. Held-out qualification remains blocked because the latest custody status request has no response.\\n\\nPlease confirm, using metadata only:\\n\\n1. Who currently owns independent authorship and custody, or whether a formal handoff is needed.\\n2. Whether the sealed T2 corpus and validators are compatible with the current `blackbox-v1` evaluator contract, or what custodian-led successor path is planned.\\n3. Whether the required coverage, author-session independence, setup/reference validation, private digest re-derivation, effective access restrictions, and immutable corpus identity have been rechecked for that path.\\n4. The next expected checkpoint or a concrete blocker requiring operator help.\\n\\nPlease do not post task payloads, hidden answers, validator contents, or private digests here. No held-out qualification will start until the custodian confirms the corpus and the evaluator boundary is independently accepted.\\n\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":548415979}},"started_at_ms":1793016586224,"completed_at_ms":1793016586772}}
