{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:11:31.184Z","ordinal":386313,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a1781c-ab2e-7de2-9db1-4e76699d51c0","turn_id":"01a1781c-ab2e-7de2-9db1-4e76699d51c0","last_agent_message":"**Progress on exact integration revision `7f52ed1b76e2fa69dee1416d1b13f1e1263ff52d`:**\n\n- Requirements enforcement passed: 123 rows, 108 tested; 12 remain deferred to exact-RC qualification.\n- Post-merge CodeQL passed.\n- Node 22 and Node 24 CI jobs passed. The Linux build and packaging job is still running, currently at the release build step: [CI run 40318063624](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40318063624).\n\nThe release is still **IN_PROGRESS**. Held-out qualification still lacks custodian acceptance, and the real-terminal matrix has no accepted results. RC8 provider verification passed, but its live task was not established as a pass. I have not started a competing test suite or changed the dirty shared checkout.","started_at":1793016507,"completed_at":1793016691,"duration_ms":183989,"time_to_first_token_ms":1660}}
