{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:22:47.561Z","ordinal":386703,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adf4614c71081a09f169c179c9f7db0","status":"completed","call_id":"call_81bdb2e1598b4e4ea329462c4b7f03bd","name":"exec","input":"const body = `## Summary\n- Preserve provider output and error-code semantics across streamed and non-streamed errors.\n- Keep partial-output failures from triggering unsafe immediate failover.\n- Retain cancellation/watchdog cleanup while reading HTTP error bodies.\n- Bound and redact provider error text.\n\n## Validation\n- Focused six-file provider suite: 134/134 passed on exact head \\`24774a1136775a9069981a5d8d9b763d8fa09253\\`.\n- \\`git diff --check\\` passed.\n- Independent review: ACCEPT; rebased diff SHA-256 \\`dc8a7d1a499262a7f7c6fa24fa062231f43890c4865d219099b35cbae720ed62\\`, byte-identical to the previously reviewed patch.\n- Exact-head PR CI is pending and required before merge.\n\n## Scope\nOnly \\`cli/src/client.ts\\`, \\`cli/src/core/provider_recovery.ts\\`, and \\`cli/test/provider_robustness.test.ts\\` are changed.`;\nconst escaped = \"'\" + body.replace(/'/g, \"'\\\\''\") + \"'\";\nconst r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:`gh pr create --base main --head v1/defect-provider-stream-integration --title 'fix: preserve provider stream and recovery semantics' --body ${escaped}`,workdir:\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/provider-stream-integration\",yield_time_ms:10000,max_output_tokens:1200}); text(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17827-f2a6-7771-8b48-8e61643c9970","create_time":1793017364.7797804}}}
