0b3f834cb44"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf494dda3881a0bc1b564f582d0cbf","order":18956,"phase":"final_answer","revision":"retained_01a17836-5c92-7b32-8d89-679ee58bacf1","text":"PR #254 remains open at head `24774a1136775a9069981a5d8d9b763d8fa09253`, based on `main@7f52ed1`. Its JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL checks passed; Node 22 and Node 24 test matrices are still running `npm --prefix cli test`, so merge remains gated.\n\nThe previous main-head CI and CodeQL are fully green. The custodian has not responded to the metadata-only request. RC8 remains unaccepted; acceptance is **IN_PROGRESS**.","turn_id":"01a1782f-1ede-7da3-bd8f-40b3f834cb44"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf4960fcbc81a0b68275adc61c4204","order":18957,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a17836-a4e0-7c91-a486-d8968e46b357","text":"I’m refreshing PR #254’s exact-head checks and the current branch head now. If the matrices finished green, I’ll merge through the authorized path and follow the resulting post-merge gates.","turn_id":"01a17836-9c39-7720-aae8-d5d9aa2875eb"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf49fe5b3c81a09d2be80b04c11d15","order":18961,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a17839-0bac-7d83-836a-689973970e3c","text":"PR #254’s Node 22 matrix has passed after 16m08s. Node 24 remains in the CLI test step; JavaScript/TypeScript and CodeQL are already green. Merge is still waiting on that last exact-head matrix.","turn_id":"01a17836-9c39-7720-aae8-d5d9aa2875eb"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf4aa9548481a099c7a6e940a6b81f","order":18965,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a1783b-a69c-7c33-85f3-0403aae40ad8","text":"PR #254’s exact-head Node 22/24 matrices, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL are all green. Its Linux packaging job is now installing pinned audit/SBOM tools before package and reproducibility checks. I’m recording that checkpoint; merge remains gated on Linux completion.","turn_id":"01a17836-9c39-7720-aae8-d5d9aa2875eb"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf4b2ebfc481a08ecd4dae8fb23b56","order":18968,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a1783d-b057-7a31-aa2f-9eb296fcbc45","text":"The PR’s Linux job has advanced to the optimized Rust build; the Node 22/24 tests remain green. I’m letting this exact-head packaging path finish rather than starting a duplicate suite.","turn_id":"01a17836-9c39-7720-aae8-d5d9aa2875eb"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf4bdc039c81a0a9761987ffc4f46e","order":18972,"phase":"final_answer","revision":"retained_01a17840-573e-7fd1-9164-d4b4b09e0ddb","text":"PR #254’s exact-head Node 22, Node 24, JavaScript/TypeScript, and CodeQL checks passed. Its Linux packaging job is still running `npm --prefix cli test`; I’ll integrate only after that job passes.\n\nThe source gates on `main@7f52ed1` are fully green. RC8 remains unaccepted, and held-out custody and the human terminal matrix are still outstanding. Acceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**.","turn_id":"01a17836-9c39-7720-aae8-d5d9aa2875eb"},{"complete":true,"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf4bf6f59081a08705b22f958d418e","order":18973,"phase":"commentary","revision":"retained_01a17840-bee4-7c00-97c5-000b2cf7ae62","text":"I’m polling PR #254’s Linux package job now. Its Node matrices have passed, so a terminal result there will determine whether I can merge it and begin the post-merge RC path.","turn_id":"01a17840-b5b4-7d21-b70b-23d081f0129e"}],"assistant_messages_incomplete":true,"incomplete":false,"next_order":18974,"sender_deliveries":[{"order":15987,"receiver_message_id":"fco_01a17087-cac9-7bf1-9191-300c6bb80f4c","receiver_turn_id":"01a1703b-4280-7320-9374-5c397c112b4d","text":"\u003e\u003e\u003e SENDER USER MESSAGES START\nReceived message: fco_01a17087-cac9-7bf1-9191-300c6bb80f4c\nSource thread: 01a15488-7e03-70f3-9a99-99c1c2bb2f1e\nHost: Up to three recent user messages with preceding assistant contex