{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:49:19.460Z","ordinal":387220,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17840-b5b4-7d21-b70b-23d081f0129e","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf4c4db17481a0b05f8ab5e447e725","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"That error identifies the RC6 → RC7 updater bug: RC6 rejected GitHub’s signed redirect to `release-assets.githubusercontent.com`. The signed URL is temporary; it doesn’t indicate a bad RC7 artifact. The failed upgrade should have left RC6 installed.\n\nThe fix is in RC8, but RC6’s updater can’t download RC8 either. To bootstrap RC8 on mike-dev, use its tagged GitHub installer:\n\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/v1.0.0-rc.8/install.sh \\\n  | NEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.8 sh\n```\n\nI verified the RC8 source allows the release-specific signed redirect. RC8 is still a prerelease, not an accepted release candidate."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1793018957740,"completed_at_ms":1793018959460}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:49:19.468Z","ordinal":387221,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf4c4db17481a0b05f8ab5e447e725","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"That error identifies the RC6 → RC7 updater bug: RC6 rejected GitHub’s signed redirect to `release-assets.githubusercontent.com`. The signed URL is temporary; it doesn’t indicate a bad RC7 artifact. The failed upgrade should have left RC6 installed.\n\nThe fix is in RC8, but RC6’s updater can’t download RC8 either. To bootstrap RC8 on mike-dev, use its tagged GitHub installer:\n\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/v1.0.0-rc.8/install.sh \\\n  | NEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.8 sh\n```\n\nI verified the RC8 source allows the release-specific signed redirect. RC8 is still a prerelease, not an accepted release candidate.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17840-b5b4-7d21-b70b-23d081f0129e","create_time":1793018957.6969779,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf4c4db17481a0b05f8ab5e447e725","turn_id":"01a17840-b5b4-7d21-b70b-23d081f0129e","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a17842-166c-7721-9e49-c340c3757965","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":18975}}
