{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:49:19.499Z","ordinal":387223,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"token_count","info":{"total_token_usage":{"input_tokens":7040843494,"cached_input_tokens":6966406144,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":19319806,"reasoning_output_tokens":11804676,"total_tokens":7060163300},"last_token_usage":{"input_tokens":83657,"cached_input_tokens":76928,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":2243,"reasoning_output_tokens":2070,"total_tokens":85900},"model_context_window":258400},"rate_limits":{"limit_id":"codex","limit_name":null,"primary":{"used_percent":28.0,"window_minutes":300,"resets_at":1793030949},"secondary":{"used_percent":17.0,"window_minutes":10080,"resets_at":1793599746},"credits":{"has_credits":false,"unlimited":false,"balance":"0"},"individual_limit":null,"spend_control_reached":null,"plan_type":"plus","rate_limit_reached_type":null}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T12:49:37.080Z","ordinal":387224,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a17840-b5b4-7d21-b70b-23d081f0129e","turn_id":"01a17840-b5b4-7d21-b70b-23d081f0129e","last_agent_message":"That error identifies the RC6 → RC7 updater bug: RC6 rejected GitHub’s signed redirect to `release-assets.githubusercontent.com`. The signed URL is temporary; it doesn’t indicate a bad RC7 artifact. The failed upgrade should have left RC6 installed.\n\nThe fix is in RC8, but RC6’s updater can’t download RC8 either. To bootstrap RC8 on mike-dev, use its tagged GitHub installer:\n\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/v1.0.0-rc.8/install.sh \\\n  | NEXUS_VERSION=v1.0.0-rc.8 sh\n```\n\nI verified the RC8 source allows the release-specific signed redirect. RC8 is still a prerelease, not an accepted release candidate.","started_at":1793018869,"completed_at":1793018977,"duration_ms":107895,"time_to_first_token_ms":1811}}
