Scope**: Preserves provider stream output and error-code semantics across streamed and non-streamed errors in [`cli/src/client.ts`](file:///home/mike/nexus-code/cli/src/client.ts), [`cli/src/core/provider_recovery.ts`](file:///home/mike/nexus-code/cli/src/core/provider_recovery.ts), and adds comprehensive regressions in [`cli/test/provider_robustness.test.ts`](file:///home/mike/nexus-code/cli/test/provider_robustness.test.ts).\\n  * Prevents partial-output failures from triggering unsafe immediate failover.\\n  * Retains watchdog/cancellation cleanup while reading HTTP error bodies.\\n  * Enforces bounds and redaction on provider error diagnostics.\\n* **Diff SHA-256**: `dc8a7d1a499262a7f7c6fa24fa062231f43890c4865d219099b35cbae720ed62` (+295, -24 across 3 files).\\n* **Validation**:\\n  * `git diff --check`: PASS (0 whitespace errors).\\n  * Fast-forward merge with `origin/main`: PASS.\\n  * Focused provider suite: 134/134 PASS on isolated worktree.\\n  * CodeQL [Run 40322090216](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40322090216): **✓ SUCCESS** (1m15s).\\n  * CI [Run 40322090307](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40322090307): IN_PROGRESS (`test-matrix (22)` and `(24)` running).\\n* **Verdict**: **ACCEPT**. High-quality robustness enhancement with thorough test coverage. Ready for owner merge upon exact-head CI completion.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-26T12:25:29Z\",\"user\":\"mikeholownych\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":550417668}},"started_at_ms":1793019129519,"completed_at_ms":1793019130070}}
