{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:18:22.545Z","ordinal":387907,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17847-ad27-7861-82f3-55336b77bcc9","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf531db31c81a0bc8f8aac599e040f","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The release claim set still has a root-owned `CLOUD` reservation scoped to RC8. RC8 is now superseded, and its live task attempt is not valid acceptance evidence, so I’m releasing that reservation with the outcome recorded; I’ll reclaim it for the exact next RC instead of letting an obsolete lane remain held."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793020701722,"completed_at_ms":1793020702545}}
