t review and exact-head CI pending., pr153_update=origin/main remains fa16045a6351ce61763bc3fcc93b562c50849285 and PR153 exact head 250dd96ab34ced55b6a27741f458dc98082b684c. CodeQL SUCCESS; setup, version, requirements source gate, cargo tests, release build, tools install all SUCCESS in both Node22/24 jobs. Both CLI suites still IN_PROGRESS. PR blocked pending exact checks; no merge. Continue monitoring., pr153_current=Exact head 250dd96: CodeQL, Node22, Node24 SUCCESS. Linux job passed setup/requirements/Rust test/build and is executing full CLI tests after starting package lane. PR154 readiness docs PR run39888503589 also remains active on Node22/24 CLI tests; current SUITE owner.json says PR154 while append-only claim log records PR153 as the claim and no logged handoff. No local tests or additional suite execution started. Preserve current workflow evidence; resolve claim discrepancy before any new suite or post-merge workflow., checkpoint_fix_integrated=PR153 merged 2026-10-23T02:44:43Z; merge commit main 429bd3141b422ca38df19745d733588cc92901c4, includes independently accepted REPL prompt parity fix. Exact PR head 250dd96 CI39888390485 SUCCESS (Node22, Node24, Linux package/repro/CLI suite); CodeQL39888390479 SUCCESS; focused 4/4; requirements enforcement passed on base fa16045. Post-merge main CI39891244410 and CodeQL39891244389 active on exact merge commit. PR154 readiness documentation remains open at c033b38 on old base fa16045; old exact checks in Linux packaging stage, and refresh is needed after current main CI. No RC tag or release., pr154=Merged as 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. Post-merge CodeQL 39891501527 SUCCESS, Node22/24 CI SUCCESS, Linux CI 39891501513 still in npm cli test at 2026-10-23 03:14 UTC. Coordination log latest confirms SUITE claim released after independent focused tests (5/5) on PR155 lane; do not start full local suite while hosted Linux test active. PR155 exact head 76b34f1d18d766b06011176a85679e7c3434ba30 against mai