{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:51:45.843Z","ordinal":388795,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1787b-40b2-7850-a1c3-ea907bb0a0ff","author":"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/current_main_rc_path_audit\nPayload:\nImplemented and committed local OpenAI-compatible endpoint setup on `v1/local-endpoint-connect`.\n\nCommit: `c3d50a1b12de75f619ea4eae403461e5d7db2c64`  \nBase: `b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`  \nDiff SHA-256: `a0977a671f6c2889ba46b6d31a9079e57c9d9157cfe7a2a08b17c30b5109e415`\n\nThe CLI and TUI now offer local endpoint setup, discover and select models, and optionally save an API key in Nexus’s owner-only credential store, scoped to that endpoint’s origin. Tests cover the visible connect menu, wizard state, CLI command, sidecar flow, and key handling. The shared checkout was left untouched; the worktree is clean. All slice and file claims were released. No push or merge was done.\n\nValidation:\n\n- `node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/provider_connect.test.ts test/provider_cli.test.ts test/protocol.test.ts` — **38/38 passed**, 4 seconds; isolated HOME `/tmp/nexus-local-connect-node3.Mf4N5b`.\n- `./node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit` — **passed**, 12 seconds; isolated HOME `/tmp/nexus-local-connect-tsc2.RfqwA3`.\n- Focused `cargo test --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml --bin nexus-tui` filters for `local_endpoint`, `key_entry_is_masked_and_unofficial_sign_in_is_labelled`, and `ctrl_p_connects` — **6 tests passed**; isolated HOME `/tmp/nexus-local-connect-rust3.yOexbm`, isolated target `/tmp/nexus-local-connect-target.NALFsk`.\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\n- `cargo fmt --check` and `rustfmt --check` report extensive existing workspace formatting drift; no mass reformatting was applied.\n\nIndependent review can now proceed against the committed branch. Acceptance and release status remain unchanged.\n\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1786b-50a4-7ce3-87df-b08e46a14ac4","create_time":1793022705.8427145}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":19063}}
