{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T13:52:21.634Z","ordinal":388834,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a1787b-cc81-7013-865c-6e37013807a8","call_id":"call_e1e591a4a01a4d438d16a495fdd59470","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Implemented and committed local OpenAI-compatible endpoint setup on `v1/local-endpoint-connect`.\\n\\nCommit: `c3d50a1b12de75f619ea4eae403461e5d7db2c64`  \\nBase: `b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421`  \\nDiff SHA-256: `a0977a671f6c2889ba46b6d31a9079e57c9d9157cfe7a2a08b17c30b5109e415`\\n\\nThe CLI and TUI now offer local endpoint setup, discover and select models, and optionally save an API key in Nexus’s owner-only credential store, scoped to that endpoint’s origin. Tests cover the visible connect menu, wizard state, CLI command, sidecar flow, and key handling. The shared checkout was left untouched; the worktree is clean. All slice and file claims were released. No push or merge was done.\\n\\nValidation:\\n\\n- `node scripts/run_tests.mjs test/provider_connect.test.ts test/provider_cli.test.ts test/protocol.test.ts` — **38/38 passed**, 4 seconds; isolated HOME `/tmp/nexus-local-connect-node3.Mf4N5b`.\\n- `./node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit` — **passed**, 12 seconds; isolated HOME `/tmp/nexus-local-connect-tsc2.RfqwA3`.\\n- Focused `cargo test --manifest-path core/Cargo.toml --bin nexus-tui` filters for `local_endpoint`, `key_entry_is_masked_and_unofficial_sign_in_is_labelled`, and `ctrl_p_connects` — **6 tests passed**; isolated HOME `/tmp/nexus-local-connect-rust3.yOexbm`, isolated target `/tmp/nexus-local-connect-target.NALFsk`.\\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\\n- `cargo fmt --check` and `rustfmt --check` report extensive existing workspace formatting drift; no mass reformatting was applied.\\n\\nIndependent review can now proceed against the committed branch. Acceptance and release status remain unchanged.\\n\\n\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/heldout_public_coverage_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Since the last audit, Issue #1 gained coordinator comment [#6406940449](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6406940449); the issue’s `updated_at` is `2026-10-26T02:33:48Z`. It says the custody request remains unanswered. All 20 comments are from the coordinator; no custodian response or handoff is visible.\\n\\nAt `main@bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, the T2 and T3 manifest hashes are unchanged: `50895b84…1f3e89b` and `85fb9caf…c9f1383`. The evaluator still rejects T2’s legacy `hidden.command` for qualification and requires custodian-led conversion or replacement, repeated custody checks, and a new immutable manifest.\\n\\nNo active held-out ownership or handoff appears in the claims records. The same external dependency remains; there is no new custody readiness.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1786b-50a4-7ce3-87df-b08e46a14ac4","create_time":1793022741.6339397}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
