{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:02:03.283Z","ordinal":389107,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1786b-50a4-7ce3-87df-b08e46a14ac4","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf5d596c3881a092dd0d3dedce497b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"That confirms the cause: **RC6 rejects GitHub’s redirect to `release-assets.githubusercontent.com`**, so its upgrade to RC7 fails after the backup. RC8 allows that download host; upgrading from RC6 to RC7 will keep failing.\n\nI haven’t retried on `mike-dev` because its SSH host key changed and still needs trusted verification. The local-provider PR is also moving: its author is addressing the independent review findings and the Node 22/24 CI failure before I push an updated revision.\n\nAcceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**; this does not establish an accepted RC or completed release.\n\n"}],"phase":"final_answer","memory_citation":{"entries":[{"path":"MEMORY.md","lineStart":27,"lineEnd":30,"note":"release verification requires proof from the actual installed deliverable"}],"rolloutIds":[]}},"started_at_ms":1793023321487,"completed_at_ms":1793023323283}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:02:03.287Z","ordinal":389108,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf5d596c3881a092dd0d3dedce497b","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"That confirms the cause: **RC6 rejects GitHub’s redirect to `release-assets.githubusercontent.com`**, so its upgrade to RC7 fails after the backup. RC8 allows that download host; upgrading from RC6 to RC7 will keep failing.\n\nI haven’t retried on `mike-dev` because its SSH host key changed and still needs trusted verification. The local-provider PR is also moving: its author is addressing the independent review findings and the Node 22/24 CI failure before I push an updated revision.\n\nAcceptance remains **IN_PROGRESS**; this does not establish an accepted RC or completed release.\n\n<oai-mem-citation>\n<citation_entries>\nMEMORY.md:27-30|note=[release verification requires proof from the actual installed deliverable]\n</citation_entries>\n<rollout_ids>\n</rollout_ids>\n</oai-mem-citation>","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1786b-50a4-7ce3-87df-b08e46a14ac4","create_time":1793023321.4250472,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf5d596c3881a092dd0d3dedce497b","turn_id":"01a1786b-50a4-7ce3-87df-b08e46a14ac4","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a17884-ac97-7a93-b03e-263724550e67","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":19088}}
