{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:06:46.474Z","ordinal":389303,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a17888-feca-7391-94e6-9cd81ffc9be8","call_id":"call_1e2430e3ef1045a0a0581eb28d2c343e","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Committed the follow-up locally as `04392899caccd728da027e44cc3c35e991a48ee6`. The diff SHA-256 is `4da76cafe93341eca27af2f55a2d75e9ffd29c7ca97de3f099db9b730888e733`.\\n\\nFocused Node tests passed 41/41, focused Rust tests passed 8/8, and the CLI build/type check passed. The worktree is clean and claims are released. No push or merge was performed.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/heldout_public_coverage_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Since the last audit, Issue #1 gained coordinator comment [#6406940449](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6406940449); the issue’s `updated_at` is `2026-10-26T02:33:48Z`. It says the custody request remains unanswered. All 20 comments are from the coordinator; no custodian response or handoff is visible.\\n\\nAt `main@bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, the T2 and T3 manifest hashes are unchanged: `50895b84…1f3e89b` and `85fb9caf…c9f1383`. The evaluator still rejects T2’s legacy `hidden.command` for qualification and requires custodian-led conversion or replacement, repeated custody checks, and a new immutable manifest.\\n\\nNo active held-out ownership or handoff appears in the claims records. The same external dependency remains; there is no new custody readiness.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17885-133d-7581-bd2d-36a0306191af","create_time":1793023606.4747236}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
