{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:10:26.031Z","ordinal":389402,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1788c-586f-7200-8adc-956b73fd1e40","author":"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/current_main_rc_path_audit\nPayload:\nCommitted the rollback fix locally as `85f9c5afbdbfc32b4198bd31f9bee9454deca42a` (parent `04392899caccd728da027e44cc3c35e991a48ee6`). Diff SHA-256: `9a5d3a189bf057a1157b83c8a2ee79dfd1b45bbbe2f2cc201b67eb8372815160`.\n\nThe new regression forces config persistence to fail and verifies that the prior config and credential state remain unchanged, including keeping a previously absent credential store absent. Focused tests passed 20/20, the TypeScript build passed, and `git diff --check` passed. The worktree is clean, claims are released, and I did not push or merge."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17885-133d-7581-bd2d-36a0306191af","create_time":1793023826.0310473}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":19119}}
