{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:10:58.550Z","ordinal":389435,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a1788c-d776-72f0-b9fb-90a6b8135050","call_id":"call_b8681721813c439f85b95e82d9dd4710","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Committed the rollback fix locally as `85f9c5afbdbfc32b4198bd31f9bee9454deca42a` (parent `04392899caccd728da027e44cc3c35e991a48ee6`). Diff SHA-256: `9a5d3a189bf057a1157b83c8a2ee79dfd1b45bbbe2f2cc201b67eb8372815160`.\\n\\nThe new regression forces config persistence to fail and verifies that the prior config and credential state remain unchanged, including keeping a previously absent credential store absent. Focused tests passed 20/20, the TypeScript build passed, and `git diff --check` passed. The worktree is clean, claims are released, and I did not push or merge.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/heldout_public_coverage_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Since the last audit, Issue #1 gained coordinator comment [#6406940449](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6406940449); the issue’s `updated_at` is `2026-10-26T02:33:48Z`. It says the custody request remains unanswered. All 20 comments are from the coordinator; no custodian response or handoff is visible.\\n\\nAt `main@bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, the T2 and T3 manifest hashes are unchanged: `50895b84…1f3e89b` and `85fb9caf…c9f1383`. The evaluator still rejects T2’s legacy `hidden.command` for qualification and requires custodian-led conversion or replacement, repeated custody checks, and a new immutable manifest.\\n\\nNo active held-out ownership or handoff appears in the claims records. The same external dependency remains; there is no new custody readiness.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17885-133d-7581-bd2d-36a0306191af","create_time":1793023858.550435}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
