{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:12:34.898Z","ordinal":389482,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a1788e-4fd2-7141-b9db-53cd5440a7ad","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\nReview of `85f9c5afbdbfc32b4198bd31f9bee9454deca42a` is **not final**. The redirect and provisional-cancel fixes look sound, and the rollback tests cover both absent and existing valid credential stores.\n\nOne remaining case: if an existing `credentials.json` is malformed, `readStore()` treats it as empty. A failed setup can therefore replace that file with an empty store instead of restoring its original contents (`credentials.ts:75-97, 123-135`). I’ve reported this to the parent and will wait for the corrected exact head before giving a final disposition."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17885-133d-7581-bd2d-36a0306191af","create_time":1793023954.8981173}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":19127}}
