{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:14:29.028Z","ordinal":389544,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_01a17890-0da4-7920-a67f-cb5507644e8e","call_id":"call_5dc29afac42042d781debffea23e8833","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/current_main_rc_path_audit\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/heldout_public_coverage_audit\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Since the last audit, Issue #1 gained coordinator comment [#6406940449](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/issues/1#issuecomment-6406940449); the issue’s `updated_at` is `2026-10-26T02:33:48Z`. It says the custody request remains unanswered. All 20 comments are from the coordinator; no custodian response or handoff is visible.\\n\\nAt `main@bbafae868939084ccd49f21621695dff6b05f752`, the T2 and T3 manifest hashes are unchanged: `50895b84…1f3e89b` and `85fb9caf…c9f1383`. The evaluator still rejects T2’s legacy `hidden.command` for qualification and requires custodian-led conversion or replacement, repeated custody checks, and a new immutable manifest.\\n\\nNo active held-out ownership or handoff appears in the claims records. The same external dependency remains; there is no new custody readiness.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/plan05_readonly_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"Review of `85f9c5afbdbfc32b4198bd31f9bee9454deca42a` is **not final**. The redirect and provisional-cancel fixes look sound, and the rollback tests cover both absent and existing valid credential stores.\\n\\nOne remaining case: if an existing `credentials.json` is malformed, `readStore()` treats it as empty. A failed setup can therefore replace that file with an empty store instead of restoring its original contents (`credentials.ts:75-97, 123-135`). I’ve reported this to the parent and will wait for the corrected exact head before giving a final disposition.\"}}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17885-133d-7581-bd2d-36a0306191af","create_time":1793024069.028696}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
