{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:17:30.775Z","ordinal":389625,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a17892-d396-7741-8cc9-558e383166a5","author":"/root/plan05_readonly_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/plan05_readonly_review\nPayload:\n**CHANGES_REQUIRED** for PR #256 at head `1198d773ddb8c27fd27e8b6cdc0a3084edb53016` against base `b73b6ecaf753ff3eba8d5e1930ede7a471359421` (diff SHA-256 `0becbc1e84740f33d40f5f4302ace84c44a2929e15f2a177399f9fc0892379d8`).\n\n- [credentials.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/local-endpoint-connect/cli/src/credentials.ts:78) checks that the store is a regular file and has an object-valued `providers` field, but does not validate the version or credential records. A parseable unsupported-version store is rewritten as v1; a malformed `null` entry for this endpoint is treated as absent and can be lost on rollback. The malformed-store test covers only invalid JSON at [provider_connect.test.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/local-endpoint-connect/cli/test/provider_connect.test.ts:574).\n- Canceling while endpoint verification is still pending can restore the canceled setup: `provider.cancel` resets the override at [sidecar.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/local-endpoint-connect/cli/src/sidecar.ts:215), but `prepareLocalEndpoint` activates it after the awaited model request at [provider_connect.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/local-endpoint-connect/cli/src/provider_connect.ts:97). The cancellation test covers only cancellation after discovery has completed ([provider_connect.test.ts](/home/mike/nexus-wt/local-endpoint-connect/cli/test/provider_connect.test.ts:622)).\n\nRedirect refusal is applied centrally to requests, and the valid prior-credential rollback test checks byte-for-byte preservation. No tests were run."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17885-133d-7581-bd2d-36a0306191af","create_time":1793024250.7748728}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":19139}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:17:33.873Z","ordinal":389626,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17885-133d-7581-bd2d-36a0306191af","item":{"type":"Reasoning","id":"rs_060b64278a9dfb15016adf60fd6ec081a0b3933191fcbe2e64","summary_text":[],"raw_content":[]},"started_at_ms":1793024253456,"completed_at_ms":1793024253873}}
