{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:17:34.917Z","ordinal":389628,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17885-133d-7581-bd2d-36a0306191af","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016adf60fdd8f081a086af8638241280ff","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The fresh review found two more concrete edge cases on `1198d77`: unsupported credential-store versions or invalid existing entries can still be rewritten, and canceling while model discovery is in flight can let a late response restore the canceled endpoint. I’m sending both for fixes and regressions; the `1198d77` CI results will remain historical if the PR advances again."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1793024253881,"completed_at_ms":1793024254917}}
