{"timestamp":"2026-10-26T14:22:02.517Z","ordinal":389752,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016adf6208d5ac81a09ff0a05cbc1211c2","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ee3b845a56a64989a541ebabe290d26d","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.mcp__mcp_search__work_state_write({list:\"nexus-v1-release\",fields:{\n  pr256_status:\"Follow-up c3bb2235286a154280f8578458a4dc8570ae542a pushed normally on PR #256 (parent 1198d77; base b73b6ec). Credential preflight now requires v1 schema and validates an existing endpoint key entry; added unsupported-version/null/invalid-key regressions preserving bytes and mode. In-flight local discovery is request-scoped, cancellation is checked after delayed model response, and late result is suppressed; regression confirms previous endpoint/model remains active and pending key is never saved. Implementer reports focused provider tests 23/23, CLI build/tsc PASS, diff-check PASS, clean worktree/claims released. Exact CI40338957629 and CodeQL40338957381 are in progress; independent review requested. No merge yet.\"\n}});\ntext(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17885-133d-7581-bd2d-36a0306191af","create_time":1793024520.8392365}}}
