ns open; latest comment remains metadata-only request 2026-10-22T22:08:34Z; no custodian response., doctor_d1b_candidate=Uncommitted change in isolated worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/doctor-integrity-scan, branch v1/doctor-integrity-scan, base 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. State scan now lstat batches capped at 128; regression test instruments 512 records and delays lstat 20ms to expose serial-timeout behavior. diff-check PASS. Tests queued until SUITE release; independent read-only review requested., current_ci=39891501513 on exact main 382e018 in_progress Node22/24 CLI test. 39891501527 CodeQL SUCCESS. Prior merge CI39891244410 on 429bd314 Node22/24 SUCCESS, linux setup active; not merged-head evidence for current main., doctor_root_cause_reconciled=Current main includes PR151: D1 event-loop starvation fixed, D2 index/schema2 false warning fixed, D3 unlisted gateway model now advisory with --deep verification. Remaining measured D1b: async serial lstat over 53,376 entries still makes integrity.check exceed 5s and warn. Focused concurrent-batch fix underway; not yet tested., doctor_d1b_pr=PR #155 opened at https\\n[Response shortened; request fewer selected records for more detail.]\"}]}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17885-133d-7581-bd2d-36a0306191af","create_time":1793024601.5993235}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
